    "988 Suicide & Crisis Lifeline" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "988 自杀与危机生命线"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "988 自殺與危機生命線"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A benzofuran analogue of MDA that acts as a serotonin-predominant monoamine releasing agent. Releases serotonin, dopamine, and norepinephrine with strong SERT selectivity. Also acts as a 5-HT2B agonist, which raises cardiovascular safety concerns with repeated use. Produces empathogenic effects similar to MDMA with a longer duration of action." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "MDA 的苯并呋喃类似物,作为以血清素为主的单胺释放剂。通过强 SERT 选择性释放血清素、多巴胺和去甲肾上腺素。同时也是 5-HT2B 激动剂,反复使用引起心血管安全顾虑。产生类似 MDMA 的共感效应,但作用时间更长。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "MDA 的苯並呋喃類似物,作為以血清素為主的單胺釋放劑。透過強 SERT 選擇性釋放血清素、多巴胺和去甲腎上腺素。同時也是 5-HT2B 激動劑,反覆使用引起心血管安全顧慮。產生類似 MDMA 的共感效應,但作用時間更長。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A benzofuran analogue that releases serotonin, dopamine, and norepinephrine via transporter reversal. Acts as an agonist at 5-HT2B receptors. Produces empathogenic and mildly psychedelic effects with a profile between MDMA and MDA." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "苯并呋喃类似物,通过转运体反转释放血清素、多巴胺和去甲肾上腺素。作为 5-HT2B 受体激动剂。产生介于 MDMA 与 MDA 之间的共感和轻度致幻效应。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "苯並呋喃類似物,透過轉運體反轉釋放血清素、多巴胺和去甲腎上腺素。作為 5-HT2B 受體激動劑。產生介於 MDMA 與 MDA 之間的共感和輕度致幻效應。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A binding-affinity measurement, not clinical potency." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这是受体结合亲和力的测定值,并非临床效价。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "這是受體結合親和力的測定值,並非臨床效價。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A busy session" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "复杂的记录"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "複雜的記錄"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A change of scenery — even moving to a different room — can shift your headspace." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "换个环境 — 即使只是换到另一个房间 — 可以改变心境。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "換個環境 — 即使只是換到另一個房間 — 可以改變心境。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A complete backup you can restore into Piru" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "可恢复到 Piru 的完整备份"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "可還原至 Piru 的完整備份"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A cool, dark room helps with headaches and overstimulation." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "凉爽、昏暗的房间有助于缓解头痛和过度刺激。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "涼爽、昏暗的房間有助於緩解頭痛和過度刺激。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A couple of drinks, with the heart rate a watch recorded alongside." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "两杯酒，以及手表同时记录的心率。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "兩杯酒，以及手錶同時記錄的心率。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A cross-taper usually switches from a short- to a long-half-life benzo: the longer drug self-tapers more smoothly. Diazepam's long-acting active metabolites stretch its effective half-life well beyond the parent." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "交叉减量通常是从短半衰期的苯二氮䓬换成长半衰期的：作用更长的药物会更平稳地自我递减。地西泮的长效活性代谢物使其有效半衰期远超母体药物。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "交叉減量通常是從短半衰期的苯二氮䓬換成長半衰期的：作用更長的藥物會更平穩地自我遞減。地西泮的長效活性代謝物使其有效半衰期遠超母體藥物。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A custom substance named \"%@\" already exists." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "已存在名为 \"%@\" 的自定义物质。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "已存在名為 \"%@\" 的自訂物質。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A daily nudge at each routine's set time so a dose never slips your mind. Tapping it opens Quick Log with the routine staged." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每天在各个日常设定的时间提醒你，不再漏掉任何一剂。点按通知即打开快捷记录，日常内容已预先排好。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每天在各個日常設定的時間提醒你，不再漏掉任何一劑。點按通知即打開快捷記錄，日常內容已預先排好。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A dipeptide nootropic structurally related to racetams but with distinct pharmacology. Modulates AMPA and NMDA glutamate receptors, enhancing long-term potentiation (LTP) and synaptic plasticity. Increases expression of brain-derived neurotrophic factor (BDNF) and nerve growth factor (NGF). Active at much lower doses than piracetam, suggesting additional mechanisms beyond glutamatergic modulation." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "结构与吡拉西坦类相关但药理学独特的二肽益智剂。调节 AMPA 和 NMDA 谷氨酸受体,增强长时程增强 (LTP) 和突触可塑性。增加脑源性神经营养因子 (BDNF) 和神经生长因子 (NGF) 的表达。在远低于吡拉西坦的剂量下即有效,提示存在谷氨酸能调节之外的其他机制。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "結構與吡拉西坦類相關但藥理學獨特的二肽益智劑。調節 AMPA 和 NMDA 麩胺酸受體,增強長時程增強 (LTP) 和突觸可塑性。增加腦源性神經滋養因子 (BDNF) 和神經生長因子 (NGF) 的表達。在遠低於吡拉西坦的劑量下即有效,提示存在麩胺酸能調節之外的其他機制。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A fast route, like insufflation, outruns that adjustment and spikes. The same dose taken slowly lets the brain keep pace, so it barely registers as a rush." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "鼻吸等快速给药方式会甩开这种调整，形成骤升。同样的剂量若缓慢摄入，大脑得以跟上节奏，便几乎感受不到冲劲。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "鼻吸等快速給藥方式會甩開這種調整，形成驟升。同樣的劑量若緩慢攝入，大腦得以跟上節奏，便幾乎感受不到衝勁。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A fast within-session fade, plus a modest, slower shift with heavy use. A bigger dose still works — but ramps the comedown and the risk, while the effect on your heart barely fades." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "同一次使用内会很快减弱，大量使用时还会有一点更慢的变化。加大剂量仍然有用——但落差和风险都会跟着上去，而对心脏的负担几乎不会减弱。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "同一次使用內會很快減弱，大量使用時還會有一點更慢的變化。加大劑量仍然有用——但落差和風險都會跟著上去，而對心臟的負擔幾乎不會減弱。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A few things to set up before you start." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "开始之前需要先设置几项内容。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "開始之前需要先設定幾項內容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A fictional drug from a 1997 TV satire on media drug panics — “Cake” isn’t real, and nothing below is either. It supposedly overstimulates “Shatner’s Bassoon,” the part of the brain that governs time. Made in Prague." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "出自 1997 年一部讽刺媒体毒品恐慌的电视节目的虚构药物——“Cake”并不存在，下面的内容也都是假的。据说它会过度刺激控制时间感的大脑区域“夏特纳的巴松管（Shatner’s Bassoon）”。产自布拉格。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "出自 1997 年一部諷刺媒體毒品恐慌的電視節目的虛構藥物——「Cake」並不存在，下面的內容也都是假的。據說它會過度刺激控制時間感的大腦區域「夏特納的巴松管（Shatner’s Bassoon）」。產自布拉格。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A fixed serving fills strength and volume when selected — like a 330 mL can. Without one, only the strength is filled." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "固定分量的饮品在选择时会同时填入浓度和容量（例如 330 mL 罐装）；没有固定分量时仅填入浓度。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "固定份量的飲品在選擇時會同時填入濃度和容量（例如 330 mL 罐裝）；沒有固定份量時僅填入濃度。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A heads-up if one substance's daily total climbs into a heavy range, or tracked stock runs low." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "当某一物质的当日总量攀升至大剂量范围，或追踪的库存不足时提醒你。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "當某一物質的當日總量攀升至大劑量範圍，或追蹤的庫存不足時提醒你。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A heads-up when it's late enough that another dose could cost you sleep." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "当时间已晚、再来一剂可能影响睡眠时，提前提醒你。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "當時間已晚、再來一劑可能影響睡眠時，提前提醒你。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A heads-up when something you track runs low or out — before the empty bottle surprises you." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "当你追踪的物品所剩不多或已用完时提前提醒——别等到瓶子空了才发现。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "當你追蹤的物品所剩不多或已用完時提前提醒——別等到瓶子空了才發現。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A heads-up when your 12-hour total of one substance reaches a heavy range. Turning this off removes a safety net." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "当某一物质 12 小时内的累积量达到大剂量范围时提醒你。关闭它等于拆掉一道安全网。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "當某一物質 12 小時內的累積量達到大劑量範圍時提醒你。關閉它等於拆掉一道安全網。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A lab measurement, not clinical potency." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这是实验室测定值,并非临床效价。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "這是實驗室測定值,並非臨床效價。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A larger dose draws dopamine stores down harder: a bigger rise, and a deeper dip once it clears." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "更大的剂量会更猛地消耗多巴胺储备：升得更高，代谢完后也跌得更深。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "更大的劑量會更猛地消耗多巴胺儲備：升得更高，代謝完後也跌得更深。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A logged dose checks this med off when the substance and route match — the same substance by another route stays a regular journal entry." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "当物质和给药途径都匹配时，一次记录会将这项用药标记为已完成 — 同一物质若经其他途径使用，仍只是普通的日志记录。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "當物質和給藥途徑都匹配時，一次記錄會將這項用藥標記為已完成 — 同一物質若經其他途徑使用，仍只是普通的日誌記錄。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A model of your dose log, not medical advice. Stopping a benzodiazepine abruptly after regular use can cause seizures." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这是基于你用药记录的模型，并非医疗建议。规律使用后突然停用苯二氮䓬可能引发癫痫发作。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "這是基於你用藥記錄的模型，並非醫療建議。規律使用後突然停用苯二氮平可能引發癲癇發作。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A modelled curve predicts what a dose *should* do; your heart rate shows what your body *actually* did — stimulants and alcohol both raise it, so seeing the two together turns a prediction into a record. A blood-pressure reading is worth attaching too: you often take one *because* you felt off." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "模型曲线预测一次用药*应该*产生的效果；而你的心率显示身体*实际*的反应——兴奋剂和酒精都会使其升高，因此将两者放在一起看，就把预测变成了记录。血压读数也值得附上：你往往*正是因为*感觉不适才会去测量。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "模型曲線預測一次用藥*應該*產生的效果；而你的心率顯示身體*實際*的反應——興奮劑和酒精都會使其升高，因此將兩者放在一起看，就把預測變成了記錄。血壓讀數也值得附上：你往往*正是因為*感覺不適才會去測量。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A notification repeats daily at this time." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每天此时重复发送通知。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每天此時重複傳送通知。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A nudge at each med's set time so a dose never slips your mind. Tapping it opens Quick Log with that time's meds staged." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在每项用药的设定时间轻轻提醒，让你不会忘记服药。轻点即可打开快速记录，并预先放入该时段的用药。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在每項用藥的設定時間輕輕提醒，讓你不會忘記服藥。點一下即可開啟快速記錄，並預先放入該時段的用藥。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A passphrase is required." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "需要口令。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "需要通行碼。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A passphrase-protected .piruenc file" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "由口令保护的 .piruenc 文件"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "由通行密語保護的 .piruenc 檔案"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A PDF summary to share with a clinician" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "可与医生分享的 PDF 摘要"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "可與醫師分享的 PDF 摘要"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A pharmacologically inactive prodrug cleaved in red blood cells to release dextroamphetamine and L-lysine. The dextroamphetamine then acts as a monoamine releasing agent via DAT, NET, SERT reversal and TAAR1 activation. The prodrug formulation provides controlled, gradual release of active drug, reducing abuse potential and producing smoother pharmacokinetics compared to immediate-release amphetamine." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在红细胞中被裂解释放右苯丙胺和 L-赖氨酸的药理学无活性前药。释放的右苯丙胺通过 DAT、NET、SERT 反转和 TAAR1 激活作为单胺释放剂。前药剂型提供受控、渐进的活性药物释放,降低滥用潜力,并比立即释放型苯丙胺产生更平滑的药代动力学。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在紅血球中被裂解釋放右苯丙胺和 L-離胺酸的藥理學無活性前藥。釋放的右苯丙胺透過 DAT、NET、SERT 反轉和 TAAR1 激活作為單胺釋放劑。前藥劑型提供受控、漸進的活性藥物釋放,降低濫用潛力,並比立即釋放型苯丙胺產生更平滑的藥動學。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A phospholipid that serves as a precursor to acetylcholine. Crosses the blood-brain barrier and increases acetylcholine synthesis and release in the brain. Also provides glycerophosphate for membrane phospholipid synthesis. Enhances cholinergic neurotransmission, which is involved in memory formation, attention, and learning." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "作为乙酰胆碱前体的磷脂。穿过血脑屏障,增加脑内乙酰胆碱的合成和释放。也提供甘油磷酸用于膜磷脂合成。增强胆碱能神经传递,后者参与记忆形成、注意力和学习。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "作為乙醯膽鹼前體的磷脂。穿過血腦屏障,增加腦內乙醯膽鹼的合成和釋放。也提供甘油磷酸用於膜磷脂合成。增強膽鹼能神經傳遞,後者參與記憶形成、注意力和學習。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A Piru or PsychonautWiki JSON file" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Piru 或 PsychonautWiki 的 JSON 文件"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Piru 或 PsychonautWiki 的 JSON 檔案"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A positional isomer of Δ9-THC with the double bond at the 8th carbon position. Acts as a partial agonist at CB1 receptors with approximately 50-75% the potency of Δ9-THC. Produces similar but milder psychoactive effects including euphoria, relaxation, and altered perception." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Δ9-THC 的位置异构体,双键位于第 8 位碳。作为 CB1 受体部分激动剂,强度约为 Δ9-THC 的 50-75%。产生类似但更温和的精神活性效应,包括欣快、放松和感知改变。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Δ9-THC 的位置異構物,雙鍵位於第 8 位碳。作為 CB1 受體部分激動劑,強度約為 Δ9-THC 的 50-75%。產生類似但更溫和的精神活性效應,包括欣快、放鬆和感知改變。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A predicted relative load from your logged doses, not a measurement. It's a model of receptor drive, not of how you feel." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这是根据记录剂量预测的相对负荷，并非实测。它建模的是受体驱动，而非你的主观感受。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "這是根據記錄劑量預測的相對負荷，並非實測。它建模的是受體驅動，而非你的主觀感受。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A prodrug converted to GHB via alcohol dehydrogenase and aldehyde dehydrogenase. Once converted, acts on GHB and GABA-B receptors. Onset and duration depend on hepatic enzyme activity. Co-administration with ethanol competitively inhibits conversion, unpredictably altering pharmacokinetics." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "通过醇脱氢酶和醛脱氢酶转化为 GHB 的前药。转化后作用于 GHB 和 GABA-B 受体。起效和持续时间取决于肝酶活性。与乙醇共同给药会竞争性抑制转化,不可预测地改变药代动力学。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "透過醇脫氫酶和醛脫氫酶轉化為 GHB 的前藥。轉化後作用於 GHB 和 GABA-B 受體。起效和持續時間取決於肝酶活性。與乙醇共同給藥會競爭性抑制轉化,不可預測地改變藥動學。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A prodrug rapidly dephosphorylated to psilocin by alkaline phosphatase. Psilocin acts as an agonist at serotonin 5-HT2A receptors (primary psychedelic target), with additional activity at 5-HT2C, 5-HT1A, and other serotonin subtypes. 5-HT2A activation on cortical pyramidal neurons increases glutamate release and enhances connectivity between brain networks that are normally segregated, producing altered perception and consciousness." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "由碱性磷酸酶迅速去磷酸化为裸盖菇素的前药。裸盖菇素作为血清素 5-HT2A 受体(主要致幻靶点)的激动剂,同时对 5-HT2C、5-HT1A 等血清素亚型也有活性。皮质锥体神经元上的 5-HT2A 激活会增加谷氨酸释放,增强通常分离的脑网络之间的连接,产生感知和意识的改变。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "由鹼性磷酸酶迅速去磷酸化為裸蓋菇素的前藥。裸蓋菇素作為血清素 5-HT2A 受體(主要致幻靶點)的激動劑,同時對 5-HT2C、5-HT1A 等血清素亞型也有活性。皮質錐體神經元上的 5-HT2A 激活會增加麩胺酸釋放,增強通常分離的腦網路之間的連結,產生感知和意識的改變。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A prodrug that is metabolized to morphine by the cytochrome P450 enzyme CYP2D6. Codeine itself has very weak affinity for μ-opioid receptors; its analgesic and antitussive effects depend on conversion to morphine. Genetic polymorphisms in CYP2D6 significantly affect efficacy — poor metabolizers get little benefit, while ultra-rapid metabolizers may experience dangerous opioid levels." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "由细胞色素 P450 酶 CYP2D6 代谢为吗啡的前药。可待因本身对 μ-阿片受体亲和力很弱;其镇痛和止咳效应依赖于转化为吗啡。CYP2D6 的基因多态性显著影响疗效 — 慢代谢者获益甚少,而超快代谢者可能出现危险的阿片水平。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "由細胞色素 P450 酶 CYP2D6 代謝為嗎啡的前藥。可待因本身對 μ-阿片受體親和力很弱;其鎮痛和止咳效應依賴於轉化為嗎啡。CYP2D6 的基因多型性顯著影響療效 — 慢代謝者獲益甚少,而超快代謝者可能出現危險的阿片水平。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A prodrug that is partially metabolized to meprobamate, which acts as a positive allosteric modulator at GABA-A receptors. The parent compound may also directly modulate GABA-A receptors and other targets. Produces muscle relaxation, sedation, and anxiolysis. The meprobamate metabolite has a long half-life and contributes to dependence potential." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "部分代谢为美普巴马的前药,后者作为 GABA-A 受体的正向变构调节剂。母体化合物也可能直接调节 GABA-A 受体和其他靶点。产生肌肉松弛、镇静和抗焦虑作用。美普巴马代谢物半衰期较长,助长依赖性潜力。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "部分代謝為美普巴馬的前藥,後者作為 GABA-A 受體的正向變構調節劑。母體化合物也可能直接調節 GABA-A 受體和其他靶點。產生肌肉鬆弛、鎮靜和抗焦慮作用。美普巴馬代謝物半衰期較長,助長依賴性潛力。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A prodrug that is rapidly converted to GHB (gamma-hydroxybutyrate) by peripheral lactonases. Once converted, acts as an agonist at GHB receptors and GABA-B receptors. Has faster onset than GHB due to rapid absorption and conversion. Carries the same steep dose-response curve and overdose risks as GHB." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "由外周内酯酶迅速转化为 GHB(γ-羟基丁酸)的前药。转化后作为 GHB 受体和 GABA-B 受体的激动剂。由于吸收和转化快速,起效比 GHB 更快。具有与 GHB 相同的陡峭剂量-反应曲线和过量风险。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "由外周內酯酶迅速轉化為 GHB(γ-羥基丁酸)的前藥。轉化後作為 GHB 受體和 GABA-B 受體的激動劑。由於吸收和轉化快速,起效比 GHB 更快。具有與 GHB 相同的陡峭劑量-反應曲線和過量風險。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A projection from your median dose and spacing, assuming you keep that cadence and linear kinetics. Body content in the dose's units, not a plasma level." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这是根据你的中位剂量与间隔做出的推算，假设你保持该节奏且动力学为线性。数值为以该剂量单位计的体内含量，而非血药浓度。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "這是根據你的中位劑量與間隔做出的推算，假設你保持該節奏且動力學為線性。數值為以該劑量單位計的體內含量，而非血藥濃度。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A pyrrolidine cathinone that potently blocks the dopamine and norepinephrine transporters (DAT/NET) without releasing monoamines and with little serotonergic activity. The strong, long-lasting rise in dopamine and norepinephrine is intensely stimulating and carries a high risk of compulsive redosing." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "一种吡咯烷类卡西酮,强效阻断多巴胺和去甲肾上腺素转运体(DAT/NET),不释放单胺,血清素活性很弱。多巴胺和去甲肾上腺素强烈而持久地升高,带来强烈兴奋,并伴有很高的强迫性反复用药风险。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "一種吡咯烷類卡西酮,強效阻斷多巴胺和正腎上腺素轉運體(DAT/NET),不釋放單胺,血清素活性很弱。多巴胺和正腎上腺素強烈而持久地升高,帶來強烈興奮,並伴有很高的強迫性反覆用藥風險。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A quick read of how potent the drug is at that target — three dots is strong, one is weak. The same scale is used on the Mechanism card." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "快速判断药物对该靶点的作用强度——三个点表示强，一个点表示弱。与「作用机制」卡片使用同一标准。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "快速判斷藥物對該靶點的作用強度——三個點表示強，一個點表示弱。與「作用機制」卡片使用同一標準。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A record and a model, not medical advice. Exposure uses clinical equivalents where they're established, and the substance's typical dose otherwise." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这是记录与模型，并非医疗建议。暴露在有公认临床当量时采用当量，否则采用该物质的常见剂量。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "這是記錄與模型，並非醫療建議。暴露在有公認臨床當量時採用當量，否則採用該物質的常見劑量。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A redose right now would land ~%lld%% as strong — within-session tachyphylaxis, recovers overnight." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "现在再次用药，效果约为 ~%lld%%——同一次使用内的快速耐受，过夜即可恢复。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "現在再次用藥，效果約為 ~%lld%%——同一次使用內的快速耐受，過夜即可恢復。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A releaser's output is limited by the vesicular dopamine still in store, and is suppressed further if a reuptake blocker is also on board. A blocker is not store-limited — it raises dopamine by slowing clearance rather than by pushing transmitter out. The two are handled by different code paths, not by one shared knob." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "释放剂的输出受限于囊泡中剩余的多巴胺存量；若同时存在再摄取抑制剂，还会被进一步压制。抑制剂则不受存量限制——它通过减慢清除而非推出递质来提升多巴胺。两者由不同的代码路径处理，而非共用一个参数。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "釋放劑的輸出受限於囊泡中剩餘的多巴胺存量；若同時存在再攝取抑制劑，還會被進一步壓制。抑制劑則不受存量限制——它透過減慢清除而非推出遞質來提升多巴胺。兩者由不同的程式路徑處理，而非共用一個參數。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A releaser's output is limited by the vesicular dopamine still in store, and is suppressed further if a reuptake blocker is also on board. A blocker is not store-limited — it raises dopamine by slowing clearance rather than by pushing transmitter out. The two are handled by different code paths." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "释放剂的输出受限于囊泡中剩余的多巴胺存量；若同时存在再摄取抑制剂，还会被进一步压制。抑制剂则不受存量限制——它通过减慢清除而非推出递质来提升多巴胺。两者由不同的代码路径处理。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "釋放劑的輸出受限於囊泡中剩餘的多巴胺存量；若同時存在再攝取抑制劑，還會被進一步壓制。抑制劑則不受存量限制——它透過減慢清除而非推出遞質來提升多巴胺。兩者由不同的程式路徑處理。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A reminder at each time. If you don't log it, Piru asks again %@ later — never a scold, just a nudge." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在每个时间提醒一次。如果你没有记录，Piru 会在 %@ 后再问一次 — 从不是责备，只是轻轻提醒。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在每個時間提醒一次。如果你沒有記錄，Piru 會在 %@ 後再問一次 — 從不是責備，只是輕輕提醒。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A reminder to drink water during stimulants and long sessions." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "使用兴奋剂或长时间用药时，提醒你补充水分。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "使用興奮劑或長時間用藥時，提醒你補充水分。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A reversible-leaning change at the serotonin transporter — a recovery-state indicator, not a dose multiplier." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "血清素转运体上偏向可逆的变化——是恢复状态指标，而非剂量倍率。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "血清素轉運體上偏向可逆的變化——是恢復狀態指標，而非劑量倍率。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A rough guide, not medical advice." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "仅供粗略参考，并非医疗建议。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "僅供粗略參考，並非醫療建議。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A safety net" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "一道安全网"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "一道安全網"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A second dose soon after the first lands weaker — the fast-releasing pool runs thin (tachyphylaxis). It refills overnight, so it's separate from the slower tolerance below. Chasing it with more rarely works and stacks the risk." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "第一次之后没多久再补一剂，效果会更弱——快速释放的那一部分被用得差不多了（快速耐受）。它过一夜就会补回来，所以和下面那种慢一点的耐受是两回事。靠多用来追效果很少奏效，反而把风险叠上去。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "第一次之後沒多久再補一劑，效果會更弱——快速釋放的那一部分被用得差不多了（快速耐受）。它過一夜就會補回來，所以和下面那種慢一點的耐受是兩回事。靠多用來追效果很少奏效，反而把風險疊上去。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A second plan is drawn as its own curve, so you can hold two ideas side by side — two meds, or a split dose against a single one." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "第二个方案会绘制为独立曲线，让你并排比较两种设想——两种药物，或分次服用与一次服用。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "第二個方案會繪製為獨立曲線，讓你並排比較兩種設想——兩種藥物，或分次服用與一次服用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A snapshot of what's active right now — effects and elimination." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此刻仍在活跃的物质快照 — 效果与消除。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此刻仍在活躍的物質快照 — 效果與消除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A snapshot of what's active right now — image, PDF, or data" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此刻仍在活跃的物质快照 — 图片、PDF 或数据。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此刻仍在活躍的物質快照 — 圖片、PDF 或資料。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A structural derivative of carbamazepine that blocks voltage-gated sodium channels in their inactivated state. Rapidly converted to its active metabolite licarbazepine (MHD). Compared to carbamazepine, has a more favorable side effect profile and fewer drug interactions due to reduced hepatic enzyme induction." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "卡马西平的结构衍生物,在失活态阻滞电压门控钠通道。迅速转化为活性代谢物 licarbazepine (MHD)。相较于卡马西平,因肝酶诱导减少,副作用谱更佳,药物相互作用较少。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "卡馬西平的結構衍生物,在失活態阻滯電壓門控鈉通道。迅速轉化為活性代謝物 licarbazepine (MHD)。相較於卡馬西平,因肝酶誘導減少,副作用譜更佳,藥物相互作用較少。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A structurally unique non-nitrogenous terpenoid that acts as a highly potent and selective agonist at κ-opioid receptors (KOR). Unlike virtually all other psychoactive compounds, has no significant activity at serotonin 5-HT2A receptors. KOR activation in the claustrum and prefrontal cortex produces intensely dissociative and hallucinatory effects. The most potent naturally occurring psychoactive compound by weight." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "结构独特的非氮萜类化合物,作为高效且选择性的 κ-阿片受体 (KOR) 激动剂。与几乎所有其他精神活性化合物不同,对血清素 5-HT2A 受体无显著活性。屏状核和前额叶皮质中的 KOR 激活产生强烈的解离和致幻效应。按重量计算,是最强效的天然存在的精神活性化合物。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "結構獨特的非氮萜類化合物,作為高效且選擇性的 κ-阿片受體 (KOR) 激動劑。與幾乎所有其他精神活性化合物不同,對血清素 5-HT2A 受體無顯著活性。屏狀核和前額葉皮質中的 KOR 激活產生強烈的解離和致幻效應。按重量計算,是最強效的天然存在的精神活性化合物。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A summary of how the drug affects the brain's three main signaling chemicals — serotonin, dopamine, and noradrenaline — and whether it releases them or blocks their reuptake. The slider shows which one it leans toward." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "概述药物如何影响大脑三种主要的信号化学物质——5-羟色胺、多巴胺和去甲肾上腺素——以及它是促进释放还是阻断再摄取。滑块显示它更偏向哪一种。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "概述藥物如何影響大腦三種主要的訊號化學物質——5-羥色胺、多巴胺和去甲腎上腺素——以及它是促進釋放還是阻斷再攝取。滑桿顯示它更偏向哪一種。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A summary of how the drug affects the brain's three main signalling chemicals — serotonin, dopamine, and noradrenaline — and whether it releases them or blocks their reuptake. The slider shows which one it leans toward." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "概述药物如何影响大脑三种主要的信号化学物质——5-羟色胺、多巴胺和去甲肾上腺素——以及它是促进释放还是阻断再摄取。滑块显示它更偏向哪一种。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "概述藥物如何影響大腦三種主要的訊號化學物質——5-羥色胺、多巴胺和去甲腎上腺素——以及它是促進釋放還是阻斷再攝取。滑桿顯示它更偏向哪一種。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A synthetic phenyl derivative of GABA that crosses the blood-brain barrier, unlike GABA itself. Primarily acts as a GABA-B receptor agonist, producing anxiolytic and sedative effects. Also binds the α2δ subunit of voltage-gated calcium channels, similar to gabapentin, reducing excitatory neurotransmitter release. At high doses, may weakly activate GABA-A receptors." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "可穿过血脑屏障的 GABA 合成苯基衍生物(与 GABA 本身不同)。主要作为 GABA-B 受体激动剂,产生抗焦虑和镇静作用。也与电压门控钙通道的 α2δ 亚单位结合(类似加巴喷丁),减少兴奋性神经递质释放。高剂量下可能弱激活 GABA-A 受体。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "可穿過血腦屏障的 GABA 合成苯基衍生物(與 GABA 本身不同)。主要作為 GABA-B 受體激動劑,產生抗焦慮和鎮靜作用。也與電壓門控鈣通道的 α2δ 亞單位結合(類似加巴噴丁),減少興奮性神經傳導物質釋放。高劑量下可能弱激活 GABA-A 受體。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A third compound your body makes from this dose and something else in the session — not from either alone." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你的身体用这次剂量和本次记录中的另一种物质生成的第三种化合物——单独任何一种都不会产生。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你的身體用這次劑量和本次記錄中的另一種物質生成的第三種化合物——單獨任何一種都不會產生。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A warm bath can ease the achy, restless feeling." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "温水浴可以缓解酸痛和不安感。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "溫水浴可以緩解痠痛和不安感。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A warm shower or light stretching helps your muscles release." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "温水淋浴或轻度拉伸有助于肌肉放松。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "溫水淋浴或輕度拉伸有助於肌肉放鬆。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A wind-down reminder late into long stimulant sessions, when sleep is the best recovery." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在长时间兴奋剂使用的后段提醒你放松入睡——此时睡眠是最好的恢复。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在長時間興奮劑使用的後段提醒你放鬆入睡——此時睡眠是最好的恢復。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A β-keto amphetamine that enters dopamine, norepinephrine, and serotonin nerve terminals through their transporters (DAT/NET/SERT) and reverses them, releasing all three monoamines. The dopamine-to-serotonin release ratio sets the character — balanced (e.g. mephedrone) is entactogenic-stimulant, dopamine-dominant is more purely stimulating." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "一种β-酮苯丙胺,经转运体(DAT/NET/SERT)进入多巴胺、去甲肾上腺素和血清素神经末梢并使其反向转运,释放这三种单胺。多巴胺与血清素的释放比例决定其特性——比例均衡(如甲卡西酮)偏向移情兴奋,多巴胺占主导则更偏纯粹兴奋。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "一種β-酮苯丙胺,經轉運體(DAT/NET/SERT)進入多巴胺、正腎上腺素和血清素神經末梢並使其反向轉運,釋放這三種單胺。多巴胺與血清素的釋放比例決定其特性——比例均衡(如甲卡西酮)偏向移情興奮,多巴胺佔主導則更偏純粹興奮。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "About" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
