    "after 21:00" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "21:00 之后"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "21:00 之後"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "After a break your opioid tolerance drops — the dose that felt fine before can stop your breathing. Hypoxia is sudden, with no warning. Restart low, and keep naloxone accessible to someone who's with you." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "中断一段时间后，你的阿片类耐受会下降——之前没问题的剂量可能让你停止呼吸。缺氧来得很突然，毫无预兆。请从低剂量重新开始，并让身边的人能随时拿到纳洛酮。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "中斷一段時間後，你的鴉片類耐受會下降——之前沒問題的劑量可能讓你停止呼吸。缺氧來得很突然，毫無預兆。請從低劑量重新開始，並讓身邊的人能隨時拿到納洛酮。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "After a break, tolerance drops fast — a dose that felt fine before can stop your breathing. Restart low." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "停一阵子后耐受会掉得很快——以前没事的剂量，这时可能让你停止呼吸。重新开始一定要减量。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "停一陣子後耐受會掉得很快——以前沒事的劑量，這時可能讓你停止呼吸。重新開始一定要減量。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "After about a %lld-day break your opioid tolerance has fallen to roughly %lld%% of full — close to none. A dose that felt fine before the break can stop your breathing now. This is the most common way people overdose." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在大约 %lld 天的间断后，你的阿片耐受已降至约满值的 %lld%%——几乎为零。间断前让你感觉没问题的剂量，现在可能让你停止呼吸。这是最常见的过量方式。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在大約 %lld 天的間斷後，你的阿片耐受已降至約滿值的 %lld%%——幾乎為零。間斷前讓你感覺沒問題的劑量，現在可能讓你停止呼吸。這是最常見的過量方式。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "After you log a med you've opted in, a nudge when its next dose window opens. An estimate, not medical advice — opt in per med." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "记录你已选择开启的药物后，会在下一剂窗口开启时提醒你。这只是估算，并非医疗建议——请按药物逐一开启。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "記錄你已選擇開啟的藥物後，會在下一劑窗口開啟時提醒你。這只是估算，並非醫療建議——請按藥物逐一開啟。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "After you log this med, a nudge when the model says its next dose window opens. An estimate, not medical advice — follow your prescriber's schedule." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "记录这种药物后，当模型判断下一剂窗口开启时提醒你。这只是估算，并非医疗建议——请遵循处方医生的安排。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "記錄這種藥物後，當模型判斷下一劑窗口開啟時提醒你。這只是估算，並非醫療建議——請遵循處方醫生的安排。"
