          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AMP 活化蛋白激酶 (AMPK) 激動劑"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AMPA-receptor positive modulators." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AMPA 受体正向调节剂。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AMPA 受體正向調節劑。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AMPAkine" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "安帕金"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "安帕金"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Amplifies GABA — it doesn't open the channel on its own." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "增强 GABA 的作用——它本身并不打开通道。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "增強 GABA 的作用——它本身並不打開通道。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "An amino acid analogue of glutamate found in tea leaves. Crosses the blood-brain barrier and increases brain levels of GABA, serotonin, and dopamine. May antagonize glutamate at AMPA receptors and modulate α-wave brain activity. Promotes relaxation without sedation, and may attenuate the anxiogenic effects of caffeine when co-administered." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "茶叶中发现的谷氨酸氨基酸类似物。穿过血脑屏障,提高脑内 GABA、血清素和多巴胺水平。可能在 AMPA 受体拮抗谷氨酸,并调节 α 波脑活动。促进放松而不镇静,与咖啡因合用时可能减弱咖啡因的致焦虑效应。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "茶葉中發現的麩胺酸胺基酸類似物。穿過血腦屏障,提高腦內 GABA、血清素和多巴胺水平。可能在 AMPA 受體拮抗麩胺酸,並調節 α 波腦活動。促進放鬆而不鎮靜,與咖啡因合用時可能減弱咖啡因的致焦慮效應。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "An electrolyte drink is better than plain water if available." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果有,电解质饮料比清水更好。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果有,電解質飲料比清水更好。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "An endogenous intermediate in phosphatidylcholine synthesis. Provides both choline (for acetylcholine synthesis) and cytidine (converted to uridine, which supports synaptic membrane formation). Enhances dopamine receptor density and dopamine release in addition to cholinergic effects. Supports neuronal membrane integrity and repair." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "磷脂酰胆碱合成中的内源性中间体。同时提供胆碱(用于乙酰胆碱合成)和胞苷(转化为支持突触膜形成的尿苷)。除胆碱能效应外还增强多巴胺受体密度和多巴胺释放。支持神经元膜的完整性和修复。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "磷脂醯膽鹼合成中的內源性中間體。同時提供膽鹼(用於乙醯膽鹼合成)和胞苷(轉化為支持突觸膜形成的尿苷)。除膽鹼能效應外還增強多巴胺受體密度和多巴胺釋放。支持神經元膜的完整性和修復。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "An estimate from a one-compartment model, not a measurement. How much is in your body doesn't always match how strong the effects feel, or how long a substance stays detectable." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这是单室模型的估算，并非实测。体内留存量与主观感受强度或可检出时长不一定一致。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "這是單室模型的估算，並非實測。體內留存量與主觀感受強度或可檢出時長不一定一致。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "An estimate of how much of each substance is still in your body. This doesn't always correspond to how strong the effects feel, or to how long it stays detectable." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每种物质在你体内残留量的估算。这并不总是与效果的强弱，或可被检测到的时长直接相关。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每種物質在你體內殘留量的估算。這並不總是與效果的強弱，或可被檢測到的時長直接相關。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "An N-benzylmethoxy derivative that acts as a highly potent full agonist at serotonin 5-HT2A receptors with much greater efficacy than partial agonists like LSD. The full agonism and high potency at 5-HT2A receptors are associated with a steeper dose-response curve, greater risk of seizures, vasoconstriction, and a narrower margin of safety compared to classical partial agonist psychedelics." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "N-苄基甲氧基衍生物,作为血清素 5-HT2A 受体的高效完全激动剂,效能远高于 LSD 等部分激动剂。在 5-HT2A 受体的完全激动和高效力与较陡的剂量-反应曲线、较大的癫痫发作和血管收缩风险及比经典部分激动致幻剂更窄的安全边际有关。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "N-苄基甲氧基衍生物,作為血清素 5-HT2A 受體的高效完全激動劑,效能遠高於 LSD 等部分激動劑。在 5-HT2A 受體的完全激動和高效力與較陡的劑量-反應曲線、較大的癲癇發作和血管收縮風險及比經典部分激動致幻劑更窄的安全邊際有關。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "An N-benzylmethoxy phenethylamine that acts as a full agonist at 5-HT2A receptors with very high potency. Like other NBOMe compounds, the full agonism contributes to a steeper dose-response curve and greater toxicity risk compared to classical psychedelics. Active at microgram doses." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "N-苄基甲氧基苯乙胺,作为 5-HT2A 受体的完全激动剂,效力极高。与其他 NBOMe 化合物一样,完全激动比经典致幻剂带来更陡的剂量-反应曲线和更大的毒性风险。在微克剂量下即有效。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "N-苄基甲氧基苯乙胺,作為 5-HT2A 受體的完全激動劑,效力極高。與其他 NBOMe 化合物一樣,完全激動比經典致幻劑帶來更陡的劑量-反應曲線和更大的毒性風險。在微克劑量下即有效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "An opioid overdose is a sudden loss of consciousness with no warning — you can't give yourself naloxone. Don't use alone: someone with you needs naloxone and should call emergency services. Nodding off can also lead to choking on vomit or burns, so never use where you might pass out unattended." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "阿片过量会毫无预兆地突然失去意识——你无法给自己使用纳洛酮。不要独自使用：身边的人需要备有纳洛酮，并应拨打急救电话。昏睡还可能导致呕吐物窒息或烧伤，因此绝不要在无人陪伴、可能昏睡过去的地方使用。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "阿片過量會毫無預兆地突然失去意識——你無法給自己使用納洛酮。不要獨自使用：身邊的人需要備有納洛酮，並應撥打急救電話。昏睡還可能導致嘔吐物窒息或燒傷，因此絕不要在無人陪伴、可能昏睡過去的地方使用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Analgesic" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "镇痛药"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "鎮痛藥"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Analgesic Agent" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "镇痛剂"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "鎮痛劑"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "And you can't use naloxone (Narcan) on yourself once that happens. Have someone with you who can, keep naloxone where they can reach it, and start much lower than your old dose." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "而一旦发生，你无法给自己使用纳洛酮（Narcan）。请让能帮你的人陪在身边，把纳洛酮放在他们够得到的地方，并且从远低于你以前的剂量开始。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "而一旦發生，你無法給自己使用納洛酮（Narcan）。請讓能幫你的人陪在身邊，把納洛酮放在他們夠得到的地方，並且從遠低於你以前的劑量開始。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Angiotensin II Receptor Blocker (ARB)" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "血管紧张素 II 受体阻滞剂 (ARB)"
