    },
    "Avoid caffeine — it amplifies the rebound anxiety." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "避免咖啡因 — 它会放大反弹性焦虑。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "避免咖啡因 — 它會放大反彈性焦慮。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Avoid driving — reaction time and judgment may still be affected." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "避免驾驶 — 反应时间和判断力可能仍受影响。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "避免駕駛 — 反應時間和判斷力可能仍受影響。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Avoid greasy, heavy food — it sounds good but often makes nausea worse." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "避免油腻的重食 — 听起来不错,但常使恶心加剧。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "避免油膩的重食 — 聽起來不錯,但常使噁心加劇。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Avoid hot baths/showers alone — you may not feel temperature accurately." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "避免独自洗热水澡 — 您可能无法准确感知温度。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "避免獨自洗熱水澡 — 您可能無法準確感知溫度。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Avoid mixing alcohol with metronidazole or certain other antibiotics — they block this same step and can make even a small drink severe." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "避免将酒精与甲硝唑或某些其他抗生素同用——它们会阻断同一步骤，可能使哪怕一小杯也变得严重。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "避免將酒精與甲硝唑或某些其他抗生素同用——它們會阻斷同一步驟，可能使哪怕一小杯也變得嚴重。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Avoid mixing substances." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "避免混用物质。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "避免混用物質。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Avoid more cannabis to 'take the edge off' the comedown." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "不要用更多大麻来「缓解」缓和期。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "不要用更多大麻來「緩解」緩和期。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Avoid painkillers that stress the liver (acetaminophen) after heavy alcohol use." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "大量饮酒后避免使用对肝脏有压力的止痛药(对乙酰氨基酚)。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "大量飲酒後避免使用對肝臟有壓力的止痛藥(對乙醯氨基酚)。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Avoid screens and doom-scrolling. Your mind is still very impressionable." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "避免使用屏幕和无止境滑动。您的心智仍非常易受影响。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "避免使用螢幕和無止境滑動。您的心智仍非常易受影響。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Avoid stairs, sharp objects, and anything requiring fine motor skills." : {
