    "Buprenorphine is a partial agonist with a ceiling on respiratory depression, so overdose risk doesn't scale linearly. CDC deliberately excludes it — MME does not apply." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "丁丙诺啡是部分激动剂，对呼吸抑制存在封顶效应，因此过量风险不呈线性增长。CDC 有意将其排除——MME 不适用。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "丁丙諾啡是部分激動劑，對呼吸抑制存在封頂效應，因此過量風險不呈線性增長。CDC 有意將其排除——MME 不適用。"
          }
        }
      }
