    "Clearance is capped at ~1 drink/hour, so each extra drink stacks on top of the last and lingers — total exposure climbs far faster than the number of drinks." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "清除速度被限制在约每小时 1 杯，因此每多喝一杯都会叠加在上一杯之上并滞留更久——总暴露量的增长远快于杯数。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "清除速度被限制在約每小時 1 杯，因此每多喝一杯都會疊加在上一杯之上並滯留更久——總暴露量的增長遠快於杯數。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Clears between doses; each peaks around %@" : {
