          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Don't 'hair of the dog' — more depressant just delays recovery." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "不要「以毒攻毒」 — 更多抑制剂只会延迟恢复。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "不要「以毒攻毒」 — 更多抑制劑只會延遲恢復。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Don't drive or make important decisions until fully sober." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "完全清醒前不要驾驶或做重要决定。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "完全清醒前不要駕駛或做重要決定。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Don't drive or make important decisions until you feel baseline." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "感觉回到基线前不要驾驶或做重要决定。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "感覺回到基線前不要駕駛或做重要決定。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Don't drive until the fog fully clears — it takes longer than you think." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "迷糊感完全消失前不要驾驶 — 比您想的要久。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "迷糊感完全消失前不要駕駛 — 比您想的要久。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Don't fight the fatigue — lie down even if sleep doesn't come immediately." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "不要对抗疲劳 — 即使一时无法入睡也躺下休息。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "不要對抗疲勞 — 即使一時無法入睡也躺下休息。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Don't isolate yourself. Let someone know where you are." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "不要独自一人。让某人知道您在哪里。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "不要獨自一人。讓某人知道您在哪裡。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Don't judge your baseline mood by how you feel right now." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "不要以现在的感受来判断您的基线情绪。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "不要以現在的感受來判斷您的基線情緒。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Don't make big life decisions based on acute revelations — wait a week." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "不要根据急性顿悟做出重大人生决定 — 等一周再说。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "不要根據急性頓悟做出重大人生決定 — 等一週再說。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Don't make important decisions or send emotionally charged messages right now." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "现在不要做重要决定或发送情绪化的信息。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "現在不要做重要決定或發送情緒化的訊息。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Don't make this worse by doom-scrolling health anxiety forums." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "不要通过滑动健康焦虑论坛让情况恶化。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "不要透過滑動健康焦慮論壇讓情況惡化。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Don't mix with depressants (alcohol, benzos, opioids) — respiratory depression risk." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "不要与抑制剂(酒精、苯二氮䓬、阿片)混用 — 有呼吸抑制风险。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "不要與抑制劑(酒精、苯二氮䓬、阿片)混用 — 有呼吸抑制風險。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Don't panic about short-term memory gaps — they resolve with sobriety." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "不要因短期记忆空白而恐慌 — 它们会随清醒恢复。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "不要因短期記憶空白而恐慌 — 它們會隨清醒恢復。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Don't redose — the magic is in spacing. Frequent use causes lasting harm." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "不要再次服用 — 关键在于间隔。频繁使用会造成持久伤害。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "不要再次服用 — 關鍵在於間隔。頻繁使用會造成持久傷害。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Don't redose reactively — it reinforces the cycle." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "不要反射性地再次服用 — 这会强化循环。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "不要反射性地再次服用 — 這會強化循環。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Don't redose to chase the feeling — tolerance builds fast and that path is dangerous." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "不要为了追求感觉而再次服用 — 耐受性会快速建立,这条路很危险。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "不要為了追求感覺而再次服用 — 耐受性會快速建立,這條路很危險。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Don't redose to escape the crash — it only delays and worsens recovery." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "不要为了逃避崩溃而再次服用 — 这只会延迟并加重恢复。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "不要為了逃避崩潰而再次服用 — 這只會延遲並加重恢復。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Don't redose while still dissociated — you can't gauge your level clearly." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "仍在解离时不要再次服用 — 您无法清楚判断自己的状态。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "仍在解離時不要再次服用 — 您無法清楚判斷自己的狀態。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Don't redose without careful consideration." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "未经仔细考虑前不要再次服用。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "未經仔細考慮前不要再次服用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Don't smoke cannabis unless you know how it interacts with your afterglow." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "不要吸食大麻,除非您了解它与余韵的相互作用。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "不要吸食大麻,除非您了解它與餘韻的相互作用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Don't stop beta-blockers cold after regular use — heart rate and blood pressure can rebound. Taper." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "规律使用 β 受体阻滞剂后别一下子停掉——心率和血压可能反弹。要逐渐减量。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "規律使用 β 受體阻滯劑後別一下子停掉——心率和血壓可能反彈。要逐漸減量。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Don't stop the clonidine-type drug suddenly while on a beta-blocker — it can spike blood pressure to dangerous levels. Taper it slowly." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在使用 beta 受体阻滞剂期间，不要突然停用可乐定类药物——可能使血压骤升至危险水平。请缓慢减量。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在使用 beta 受體阻滯劑期間，不要突然停用可樂定類藥物——可能使血壓驟升至危險水平。請緩慢減量。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Don't stop α₂-agonists cold after regular use — blood pressure can rebound. Taper." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "规律使用 α₂ 激动剂后别一下子停掉——血压可能反弹。要逐渐减量。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "規律使用 α₂ 激動劑後別一下子停掉——血壓可能反彈。要逐漸減量。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Don't try to 'figure it all out' right now. Integration takes days, not hours." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "现在不要试图「想通一切」。整合需要数天,而不是数小时。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "現在不要試圖「想通一切」。整合需要數天,而不是數小時。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Don't try to 'figure it all out' right now. Integration takes days." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "现在不要试图「想通一切」。整合需要数天。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "現在不要試圖「想通一切」。整合需要數天。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Don't use alone and don't mix with other downers. An overdose is a sudden blackout with no warning — you can't naloxone yourself, so someone with you needs it and should call emergency services." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "不要独自使用，也不要与其他抑制剂混用。过量会毫无预兆地突然失去意识——你无法给自己使用纳洛酮，因此身边的人需要备有纳洛酮，并应拨打急救电话。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "不要獨自使用，也不要與其他抑制劑混用。過量會毫無預兆地突然失去意識——你無法給自己使用納洛酮，因此身邊的人需要備有納洛酮，並應撥打急救電話。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
