    "Dose reminders and session nudges inside this window stay silent. Cumulative dose warnings and reminders you set to an exact time still come through." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此时间段内的剂量提醒和使用期间提醒将保持静默。累积剂量警告以及你设定了确切时间的提醒仍会送达。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此時間段內的劑量提醒和使用期間提醒將保持靜默。累積劑量警告以及你設定了確切時間的提醒仍會送達。"
