    },
    "Dosed in low milligrams — use a precise milligram scale (0.001 g resolution). Hard to measure accurately by eye or with kitchen scales." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "以低毫克量级给药 — 请使用精密毫克秤（0.001 克精度）。靠目测或厨房秤难以准确称量。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "以低毫克量級給藥 — 請使用精密毫克秤（0.001 克精度）。靠目測或廚房秤難以準確秤量。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Doses" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "剂量"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "劑量"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Doses add with no plateau, and the gap between a sedating dose and a fatal one is narrow to begin with." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "剂量相加且不会趋于平缓，而镇静剂量与致死剂量之间的差距本就很窄。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "劑量相加且不會趨於平緩，而鎮靜劑量與致死劑量之間的差距本就很窄。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Doses are milligrams of THC, not flower weight. Flower needed ≈ desired THC ÷ the strain's %THC (e.g. 3 mg ÷ 18% ≈ 0.02 g). Smoking loses 50–80% to combustion, so real flower amounts run higher." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "剂量是 THC 的毫克数，而非花的重量。所需花量 ≈ 目标 THC ÷ 品系的 THC 含量百分比（例如 3 mg ÷ 18% ≈ 0.02 g）。吸食会因燃烧损失 50–80%，因此实际所需花量更高。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "劑量是 THC 的毫克數，而非花的重量。所需花量 ≈ 目標 THC ÷ 品系的 THC 含量百分比（例如 3 mg ÷ 18% ≈ 0.02 g）。吸食會因燃燒損失 50–80%，因此實際所需花量更高。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Doses are milligrams of THC. Flower needed ≈ desired THC ÷ the strain's %THC (e.g. 3 mg ÷ 18% ≈ 0.02 g). Smoking loses 50–80% to combustion, so real flower amounts run higher." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "剂量是 THC 的毫克数。所需花量 ≈ 目标 THC ÷ 品系的 THC 含量百分比（例如 3 mg ÷ 18% ≈ 0.02 g）。吸食会因燃烧损失 50–80%，因此实际所需花量更高。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "劑量是 THC 的毫克數。所需花量 ≈ 目標 THC ÷ 品系的 THC 含量百分比（例如 3 mg ÷ 18% ≈ 0.02 g）。吸食會因燃燒損失 50–80%，因此實際所需花量更高。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Doses in other units aren't counted." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "其他单位的剂量不计入。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "其他單位的劑量不計入。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Doses logged before this hour are grouped with the previous day's session — so a 02:00 dose joins the night before instead of starting a new day at midnight. Set to 12 AM for classic calendar-day grouping." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在此小时之前记录的剂量会与前一天的会话分到一组 — 例如 02:00 的剂量会归入前一晚,而不是从午夜开始新的一天。设为凌晨 12 点即为传统日历日分组。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在此小時之前記錄的劑量會與前一天的工作階段分到一組 — 例如 02:00 的劑量會歸入前一晚,而不是從午夜開始新的一天。設為凌晨 12 點即為傳統日曆日分組。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Doses logged before this hour count toward the previous day — so a 2 AM dose stays with the night before instead of starting a new day at midnight. Set to 12 AM for standard calendar days." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在此时刻之前记录的剂量将归入前一天——因此凌晨 2 点的剂量会留在前一晚，而不是在午夜开启新的一天。设为午夜 12 点即按标准日历日分组。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在此時刻之前記錄的劑量將歸入前一天——因此凌晨 2 點的劑量會留在前一晚，而不是在午夜開啟新的一天。設為午夜 12 點即按標準日曆日分組。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Doses logged per day over the past two weeks" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "过去两周每天记录的剂量数"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "過去兩週每天記錄的劑量數"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Doses stack faster than they clear — the level climbs to roughly %@ a single dose and takes about %@ to get there." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "用药速度快于清除速度——体内水平升至单次剂量的约 %@，约需 %@ 才能达到。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "用藥速度快於清除速度——體內水平升至單次劑量的約 %@，約需 %@ 才能達到。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dosing Defaults" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "剂量默认值"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "劑量預設值"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dosing for this medication is determined by a healthcare provider and is not shown here. The information below is for recognition and reference only." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "该药物的用量由医疗专业人员决定，此处不予显示。以下信息仅供识别与参考。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "該藥物的用量由醫療專業人員決定，此處不予顯示。以下資訊僅供辨識與參考。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dosing shown reflects clinical or community research protocols, not medical advice. Peptides are injected from reconstituted powder — handle and store as noted below." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "所示剂量反映临床或社区研究方案，并非医疗建议。肽类需由冻干粉复溶后注射——请按下方说明处理和储存。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "所示劑量反映臨床或社群研究方案，並非醫療建議。胜肽需由凍乾粉復溶後注射——請按下方說明處理與儲存。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
