        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "例如：早晨、鍛鍊前、夜間"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each card blends these into one reading: how much of your usual dose you'd feel now, and how long until it returns if you stop." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每张卡片把这几样合成一个结果：你现在还能感受到平时剂量的多少，以及停下来后要多久才能恢复。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每張卡片把這幾樣合成一個結果：你現在還能感受到平時劑量的多少，以及停下來後要多久才能恢復。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each card is that substance's own contribution. Mechanisms are shared, so your overall level (the chart above, or By mechanism) can be higher." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每张卡片是该物质自身的贡献。机制是共享的，所以你的整体水平（上方图表或“按机制”）可能更高。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每張卡片是該物質自身的貢獻。機制是共享的，所以你的整體水平（上方圖表或「按機制」）可能更高。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each dose has mostly cleared before the next, so the level tracks a single dose." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在下一剂之前，每一剂大多已被清除，因此体内水平与单次剂量相当。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在下一劑之前，每一劑大多已被清除，因此體內水平與單次劑量相當。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each line is a mechanism recovering — a steeper climb means a faster reset." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每条线是一种机制在恢复——爬得越陡，重置得越快。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每條線是一種機制在恢復——爬得越陡，重置得越快。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each line is a mechanism recovering — a steeper climb means a faster reset. Showing the first 60 days." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
