    "Every backup is sealed with AES-256-GCM — the same authenticated encryption used by modern secure messengers. Tampering is detected and refused." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每个备份都使用 AES-256-GCM 封装——与现代安全通讯软件采用的认证加密相同。任何篡改都会被检测并拒绝。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每個備份都使用 AES-256-GCM 封裝——與現代安全通訊軟體採用的認證加密相同。任何竄改都會被偵測並拒絕。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every curve starts as a number you typed and ends as a line on a chart. These are the steps in between." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每条曲线都始于你输入的一个数字，终于图上的一条线。以下是中间的每一步。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每條曲線都始於你輸入的一個數字，終於圖上的一條線。以下是中間的每一步。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every dose lands on a timeline so you can see what's active — and when it fades." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每一笔剂量都会落在时间轴上，让你看清什么正在起效——以及何时消退。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每一筆劑量都會落在時間軸上，讓你看清什麼正在起效——以及何時消退。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every other day" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "隔日"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "隔日"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every substance shares one set of neural constants. Only the store-depletion susceptibility is fitted per substance, anchored to the observed contrast between an amphetamine crash and a crashless cathinone." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "所有物质共用同一组神经常数。只有存量耗竭易感性是逐物质拟合的，其锚点是安非他命崩落与不产生崩落的卡西酮之间的实测反差。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "所有物質共用同一組神經常數。只有存量耗竭易感性是逐物質擬合的，其錨點是安非他命崩落與不產生崩落的卡西酮之間的實測反差。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Everyday substances, by the names most people know." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "日常物质，以大多数人熟知的名称呈现。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "日常物質，以大多數人熟知的名稱呈現。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Everyday things — foods like grapefruit, smoking, or the drug's own buildup over repeated doses — can speed up or slow down how fast it's cleared, which raises or lowers its levels in the body." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "日常因素——如西柚等食物、吸烟，或反复用药导致药物自身蓄积——都可能加快或减慢其清除速度，从而升高或降低其在体内的浓度。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "日常因素——如葡萄柚等食物、吸菸，或反覆用藥導致藥物自身蓄積——都可能加快或減慢其清除速度，從而升高或降低其在體內的濃度。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Everything — receptor binding tables, biased agonism, CYP metabolism, citations down to DOI." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "全部内容 — 受体结合表、偏向性激动、CYP 代谢，以及精确到 DOI 的文献引用。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "全部內容 — 受體結合表、偏向性激動、CYP 代謝，以及精確到 DOI 的文獻引用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Everything Piru stores locally. Your dose data lives only on this device unless you turn on iCloud backup." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Piru 在本机存储的全部内容。除非开启 iCloud 备份，你的剂量数据只保存在这台设备上。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Piru 在本機儲存的全部內容。除非開啟 iCloud 備份，你的劑量資料只保存在這部裝置上。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Everything present draws on one shared pool of free transporters, so a second substance finds fewer sites open. This is the point where combinations stop being additive." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在场的所有物质共用同一个空闲转运体池，因此第二种物质可用的位点更少。组合效应正是从这里开始不再是简单相加。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在場的所有物質共用同一個空閒轉運體池，因此第二種物質可用的位點更少。組合效應正是從這裡開始不再是簡單相加。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Everything that doesn't fit a class above." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "不属于以上任何类别的物质。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "不屬於以上任何類別的物質。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Everything's rested — nothing recovering right now." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "一切都休息好了——现在没有在恢复的。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "一切都休息好了——現在沒有在恢復的。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Evidence source: %@, %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "数据来源：%@，%@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "數據來源：%@，%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Exact mechanism incompletely understood. Inhibits inositol monophosphatase (IMPase), depleting inositol and modulating phosphoinositide signaling. Inhibits glycogen synthase kinase-3β (GSK-3β), regulating neuroplasticity, circadian rhythm, and neuroprotection. Modulates glutamate neurotransmission by reducing NMDA receptor activity. Also affects protein kinase C, cAMP, and arachidonic acid metabolism." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "确切机制尚未完全了解。抑制肌醇单磷酸酶 (IMPase),消耗肌醇并调节磷酸肌醇信号传导。抑制糖原合成激酶-3β (GSK-3β),调节神经可塑性、昼夜节律和神经保护。通过降低 NMDA 受体活性调节谷氨酸神经传递。也影响蛋白激酶 C、cAMP 和花生四烯酸代谢。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "確切機制尚未完全了解。抑制肌醇單磷酸酶 (IMPase),消耗肌醇並調節磷酸肌醇訊號傳導。抑制糖原合成激酶-3β (GSK-3β),調節神經可塑性、晝夜節律和神經保護。透過降低 NMDA 受體活性調節麩胺酸神經傳導。也影響蛋白激酶 C、cAMP 和花生四烯酸代謝。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Exact mechanism not fully established. Activates AMP-activated protein kinase (AMPK), which inhibits hepatic gluconeogenesis and increases insulin sensitivity in peripheral tissues. Also inhibits mitochondrial complex I, altering the cellular energy state. Does not stimulate insulin secretion and does not cause hypoglycemia when used alone. May also modulate the gut microbiome and increase GLP-1 levels." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "确切机制尚未完全确立。激活 AMP 活化蛋白激酶 (AMPK),抑制肝糖异生并增加外周组织的胰岛素敏感性。也抑制线粒体复合物 I,改变细胞能量状态。不刺激胰岛素分泌,单独使用时不引起低血糖。也可能调节肠道微生物组并提高 GLP-1 水平。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "確切機制尚未完全確立。激活 AMP 活化蛋白激酶 (AMPK),抑制肝糖異生並增加外周組織的胰島素敏感性。也抑制粒線體複合體 I,改變細胞能量狀態。不刺激胰島素分泌,單獨使用時不引起低血糖。也可能調節腸道微生物組並提高 GLP-1 水平。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Exact mechanism not fully established. Modulates AMPA-type glutamate receptors (positive allosteric modulation), enhancing glutamatergic neurotransmission and synaptic plasticity. May also increase acetylcholine turnover and improve cerebral blood flow. Individual racetams vary in their receptor selectivity and additional mechanisms." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "确切机制尚未完全确立。调节 AMPA 型谷氨酸受体(正向变构调节),增强谷氨酸能神经传递和突触可塑性。也可能增加乙酰胆碱周转并改善脑血流。各吡拉西坦类药物在受体选择性和其他机制上有所不同。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "確切機制尚未完全確立。調節 AMPA 型麩胺酸受體(正向變構調節),增強麩胺酸能神經傳導和突觸可塑性。也可能增加乙醯膽鹼周轉並改善腦血流。各吡拉西坦類藥物在受體選擇性和其他機制上有所不同。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Example chart: an alcohol effect curve with heart rate rising and falling alongside it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "示例图表：酒精效应曲线，心率随之起伏。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "範例圖表：酒精效應曲線，心率隨之起伏。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Excessive sedation and respiratory depression risk." : {
