            "value" : "下降"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Familiar songs can ground you and bring comfort. Pick something you know well." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "熟悉的歌曲能让您找回脚踏实地的感觉并带来慰藉。选一首您熟悉的吧。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "熟悉的歌曲能讓您找回腳踏實地的感覺並帶來慰藉。選一首您熟悉的吧。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fast and real, but recovers fairly quickly once you stop." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "又快又真实，但停用后恢复得相当快。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "又快又真實，但停用後恢復得相當快。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Faster conversion to active metabolite — higher active metabolite exposure. For codeine, this is an FDA contraindication due to the risk of respiratory depression." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "活性代谢物转化加快——活性代谢物暴露量更高。对于可待因，因呼吸抑制风险，FDA 列为禁忌。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "活性代謝物轉化加快——活性代謝物暴露量更高。對於可待因，因呼吸抑制風險，FDA 列為禁忌。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Faster CYP2D6 clearance — shorter duration. Be aware of re-dose timing." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "CYP2D6 清除加快——持续时间更短。注意补服时机。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "CYP2D6 清除加快——持續時間更短。注意補服時機。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fatigue, irritability, and low mood are all normal parts of this process." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "疲倦、易怒和情绪低落都是此过程中的正常表现。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "疲倦、易怒和情緒低落都是此過程中的正常表現。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
