    "Heavy additive sedation — profound drowsiness and impaired breathing." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "镇静作用强烈相加——严重嗜睡与呼吸受损。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "鎮靜作用強烈相加——嚴重嗜睡與呼吸受損。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Heavy chronic use has shifted your baseline; the deepest part recovers over months." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "长期大量使用已经把你的基线压低了；最深的那部分要几个月才能恢复。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "長期大量使用已經把你的基線壓低了；最深的那部分要幾個月才能恢復。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Heavy regular use builds dependence — stopping abruptly can be dangerous. Taper." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "长期大量使用会形成依赖——突然停用可能很危险。要逐渐减量。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "長期大量使用會形成依賴——突然停用可能很危險。要逐漸減量。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Heavy sedation with a dangerously slow heart rate and breathing. Naloxone reverses the opioid but NOT the alpha-2 part — give rescue breaths and call for help even after naloxone." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "强烈镇静，伴心率和呼吸危险性减慢。纳洛酮能逆转阿片，但无法逆转 alpha-2 的作用——即使用了纳洛酮，也要进行人工呼吸并呼叫求助。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "強烈鎮靜，伴心率和呼吸危險性減慢。納洛酮能逆轉鴉片，但無法逆轉 alpha-2 的作用——即使用了納洛酮，也要進行人工呼吸並呼叫求助。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
