      }
    },
    "icon or long press doses to select multiple at once" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "图标或长按剂量以一次选择多个"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "圖示或長按劑量以一次選擇多個"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "icon to log several at once, or long press a dose to remove or reorder it" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "图标可一次记录多个，或长按某个剂量以移除或重新排序"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "圖示可一次記錄多個，或長按某個劑量以移除或重新排序"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If a dose is too much, you don't feel it coming — breathing just stops and you black out with no warning. There's no moment where you notice and react." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果剂量过量，你不会有任何预兆——呼吸会直接停止，你会在毫无征兆的情况下失去意识。没有让你察觉并作出反应的时机。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果劑量過量，你不會有任何預兆——呼吸會直接停止，你會在毫無徵兆的情況下失去意識。沒有讓你察覺並作出反應的時機。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If a dose isn't logged, ask again after these intervals. Applies to every med. A med can override or opt out in its own settings. Re-asks never scold — they just ask." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果剂量未记录，按这些间隔再次提醒。适用于所有药物。每种药物可单独覆盖或退出。再次提醒绝不训斥——只是问一声。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果劑量未記錄，按這些間隔再次提醒。適用於所有藥物。每種藥物可單獨覆蓋或退出。再次提醒絕不訓斥——只是問一聲。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If nauseous, small sips of water and lying on your side help." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "感到恶心时,小口喝水并侧卧有帮助。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "感到噁心時,小口喝水並側臥有幫助。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If taken over a day, this is a high-risk daily MME." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "若一天内服用，这属于高风险的每日 MME。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "若一天內服用，這屬於高風險的每日 MME。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If taken over a day, this reaches the CDC caution band." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "若一天内服用，这已达到 CDC 谨慎分级。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "若一天內服用，這已達到 CDC 謹慎分級。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If this is frequent for you, consider talking to a professional about alternatives." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果这对您很频繁,请考虑与专业人士讨论替代方案。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果這對您很頻繁,請考慮與專業人士討論替代方案。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If withdrawal symptoms concern you, seek medical advice. Help exists." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果担心戒断症状,请寻求医疗建议。帮助是存在的。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果擔心戒斷症狀,請尋求醫療建議。幫助是存在的。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If you are using phenibut or F-phenibut daily, dependence develops within weeks. Protracted withdrawal can last months — taper gradually with medical guidance." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果你每天使用苯乙胺丁酸或氟苯乙胺丁酸，数周内就会产生依赖。迁延性戒断可持续数月——在医疗指导下逐步减量。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果你每天使用苯乙胺丁酸或氟苯乙胺丁酸，數週內就會產生依賴。遷延性戒斷可持續數月——在醫療指導下逐步減量。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If you feel anxious, focus on slow breathing. It passes." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果感到焦虑,专注于慢呼吸。它会过去。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果感到焦慮,專注於慢呼吸。它會過去。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If you feel nauseous, lie on your side and sip ginger tea or plain water." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "感到恶心时,侧卧并小口喝姜茶或清水。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "感到噁心時,側臥並小口喝薑茶或清水。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If you feel spacey, grounding exercises: name 5 things you can see, 4 you can touch." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果感觉飘忽,做接地练习:说出 5 件您能看见的、4 件能触摸的。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果感覺飄忽,做接地練習:說出 5 件您能看見的、4 件能觸摸的。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If you feel unwell, don't hesitate to call for help." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如感到不适,请毫不犹豫地寻求帮助。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如感到不適,請毫不猶豫地尋求幫助。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If you have been drinking heavily and daily for weeks, stopping abruptly can be medically dangerous — seizures and delirium tremens peak 2–4 days after the last drink. Seek medical advice before going cold turkey." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果你连续数周每天大量饮酒，突然戒断可能非常危险——癫痫发作和震颤性谵妄通常在最后一杯后 2–4 天达到高峰。戒酒前请先咨询医生。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果你連續數週每天大量飲酒，突然戒斷可能非常危險——癲癇發作和震顫性譫妄通常在最後一杯後 2–4 天達到高峰。戒酒前請先諮詢醫師。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If you lose this passphrase, the backup can't be recovered. There is no reset." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果你丢失此口令，备份将无法恢复。无法重置。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果你遺失此通行碼，備份將無法還原。無法重設。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If you need help right now:" : {
      "localizations" : {
