            "value" : "繼續記錄"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep Quick-Log Order" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "保持快速记录顺序"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "保持快速記錄順序"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep tabs on what you have on hand and get a heads-up when it runs low." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "随时掌握你的现有量，库存不足时提醒你。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "隨時掌握你的現有量，庫存不足時提醒你。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep track of what you take and when — one tap to set up gentle reminders. Prescriptions, supplements, vitamins: anything on a schedule." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "记录你服用了什么、何时服用 — 轻点一下即可设置温和的提醒。处方药、补剂、维生素：任何按计划服用的东西。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "記錄你服用了什麼、何時服用 — 點一下即可設定溫和的提醒。處方藥、補劑、維生素：任何按計劃服用的東西。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep your quick-log doses in a fixed order. When off, logging a dose moves it to the front so your most-used doses stay on top." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "让快速记录中的剂量保持固定顺序。关闭时，记录某个剂量会将其移到最前，使常用剂量始终置顶。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "讓快速記錄中的劑量保持固定順序。關閉時，記錄某個劑量會將其移到最前，使常用劑量始終置頂。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keeps this medication out of your sessions — it joins an active session if one is running, but on its own never starts a new session. Maintenance meds show as a compact “Medications” row in the Journal." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "让这种药物不计入你的记录——如果当前有进行中的记录，它会并入其中，但自身永远不会开启新的记录。维持类用药会在日志中显示为紧凑的“用药”行。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "讓這種藥物不計入你的記錄——如果目前有進行中的記錄，它會併入其中，但自身永遠不會開啟新的記錄。維持類用藥會在日誌中顯示為精簡的“用藥”列。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
