            "value" : "最高血藥濃度"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "May reduce hormonal birth-control efficacy" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "可能降低激素类避孕药的效果"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "可能降低激素類避孕藥的效果"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mCPP acts on serotonin in a different way than trazodone — it tends to feel activating or anxious rather than sedating, which is part of why trazodone's later hours can feel unlike its calm onset." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "mCPP 以不同于曲唑酮的方式作用于血清素——它倾向于产生激活感或焦虑感,而非镇静,这是曲唑酮后半段感受可能与平静的起效阶段不同的部分原因。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "mCPP 以不同於曲唑酮的方式作用於血清素——它傾向於產生激活感或焦慮感,而非鎮靜,這是曲唑酮後半段感受可能與平靜的起效階段不同的部分原因。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MDA is an active drug of its own — more amphetamine-like and more hallucinogenic than MDMA, and longer-lived — so the later hours can feel qualitatively different from the peak." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "MDA 本身就是一种活性药物——比 MDMA 更像安非他明、致幻性更强，也更持久——因此后段时间的体验在性质上会与峰值不同。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "MDA 本身就是一種活性藥物——比 MDMA 更像安非他命、致幻性更強，也更持久——因此後段時間的體驗在性質上會與峰值不同。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MDMA" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "MDMA"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "MDMA"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MDMA inactivates the CYP2D6 that clears it, so repeated or closely-spaced doses build up disproportionately rather than in proportion to the dose. The enzyme recovers over about 10 days." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "MDMA 会使清除它的 CYP2D6 失活，因此反复或间隔很短的用药会不成比例地累积，而非与剂量成正比。该酶约需 10 天恢复。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "MDMA 會使清除它的 CYP2D6 失活，因此反覆或間隔很短的用藥會不成比例地累積，而非與劑量成正比。該酶約需 10 天恢復。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Measure" : {

    },
    "Measured at %@× %@'s %@ — a lab measurement, not clinical potency." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Measured at %1$@× %2$@'s %3$@ — a lab measurement, not clinical potency."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "测定值为 %2$@ %3$@的 %1$@ 倍——这是实验室测定值,并非临床效价。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "測定值為 %2$@ %3$@的 %1$@ 倍——這是實驗室測定值,並非臨床效價。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Measured at %@× %@'s %@ at the %@ — a lab measurement, not clinical potency." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Measured at %1$@× %2$@'s %3$@ at the %4$@ — a lab measurement, not clinical potency."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
