    },
    "Measures how tightly the drug grips the target (Ki). A smaller number means a tighter grip — under 100 nM is strong, over 1000 nM is weak." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "衡量药物与靶点结合的紧密程度（Ki）。数值越小，结合越紧密——低于 100 nM 为强，高于 1000 nM 为弱。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "衡量藥物與靶點結合的緊密程度（Ki）。數值越小，結合越緊密——低於 100 nM 為強，高於 1000 nM 為弱。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Measures how tightly the drug grips the target (Ki). A smaller number means a tighter grip." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "衡量药物与靶点结合的紧密程度（Ki）。数值越小，结合越紧密。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "衡量藥物與靶點結合的緊密程度（Ki）。數值越小，結合越緊密。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Measures the dose needed to actually switch the target on or block it, rather than just stick to it. Also smaller = more potent." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "衡量真正激活或阻断靶点（而不仅仅是附着其上）所需的剂量。同样是数值越小、作用越强。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "衡量真正激活或阻斷靶點（而不僅僅是附著其上）所需的劑量。同樣是數值越小、作用越強。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Measures the dose needed to actually switch the target on or block it, rather than just stick to it. These run about 10× higher than binding, so the dots use a matching scale (under 1 µM strong, over 10 µM weak)." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "衡量真正激活或阻断靶点（而非仅仅附着其上）所需的剂量。其数值通常比结合亲和力高约 10 倍，因此圆点采用相应的刻度（低于 1 µM 为强，高于 10 µM 为弱）。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "衡量真正激活或阻斷靶點（而非僅僅附著其上）所需的劑量。其數值通常比結合親和力高約 10 倍，因此圓點採用相應的刻度（低於 1 µM 為強，高於 10 µM 為弱）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mechanism" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "作用机制"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "作用機制"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mechanism incompletely understood despite widespread use. Weakly inhibits COX peripherally but primarily acts centrally. Its active metabolite AM404 inhibits endocannabinoid reuptake, increasing anandamide levels and activating CB1 and TRPV1 receptors. Also inhibits prostaglandin synthesis in the CNS, producing antipyretic effects via the hypothalamus. Lacks significant anti-inflammatory activity." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "尽管广泛使用,机制仍未完全了解。在外周弱抑制 COX,主要在中枢起作用。其活性代谢物 AM404 抑制内源性大麻素再摄取,提高花生四烯酸乙醇胺水平并激活 CB1 和 TRPV1 受体。也在中枢抑制前列腺素合成,通过下丘脑产生退热效应。缺乏显著的抗炎活性。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "儘管廣泛使用,機制仍未完全了解。在外周弱抑制 COX,主要在中樞起作用。其活性代謝物 AM404 抑制內源性大麻素再攝取,提高花生四烯酸乙醇胺水平並激活 CB1 和 TRPV1 受體。也在中樞抑制前列腺素合成,透過下丘腦產生退熱效應。缺乏顯著的抗炎活性。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mechanism incompletely understood. Weakly inhibits COX peripherally but primarily acts centrally. Its active metabolite AM404 inhibits endocannabinoid reuptake, increasing anandamide levels and activating CB1 and TRPV1 receptors. Also inhibits prostaglandin synthesis in the CNS. Lacks significant anti-inflammatory activity." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "机制尚未完全了解。在外周弱抑制 COX,主要在中枢起作用。其活性代谢物 AM404 抑制内源性大麻素再摄取,提高花生四烯酸乙醇胺水平并激活 CB1 和 TRPV1 受体。也在中枢抑制前列腺素合成。缺乏显著的抗炎活性。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "機制尚未完全了解。在外周弱抑制 COX,主要在中樞起作用。其活性代謝物 AM404 抑制內源性大麻素再攝取,提高花生四烯酸乙醇胺水平並激活 CB1 和 TRPV1 受體。也在中樞抑制前列腺素合成。缺乏顯著的抗炎活性。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mechanism not fully established. Weakly inhibits the dopamine transporter (DAT), increasing extracellular dopamine. Also activates hypothalamic orexin/hypocretin neurons and increases histamine release in the tuberomammillary nucleus, both promoting wakefulness. Modulates norepinephrine, serotonin, and glutamate/GABA balance. Unlike amphetamines, does not significantly release catecholamines." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "机制尚未完全确立。弱抑制多巴胺转运体 (DAT),增加细胞外多巴胺。也激活下丘脑促醒素/食欲素神经元,增加结节乳头核中的组胺释放,二者均促进清醒。调节去甲肾上腺素、血清素和谷氨酸/GABA 的平衡。与苯丙胺类不同,不显著释放儿茶酚胺。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "機制尚未完全確立。弱抑制多巴胺轉運體 (DAT),增加細胞外多巴胺。也激活下丘腦促醒素/食慾素神經元,增加結節乳頭核中的組胺釋放,二者均促進清醒。調節去甲腎上腺素、血清素和麩胺酸/GABA 的平衡。與苯丙胺類不同,不顯著釋放兒茶酚胺。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
