    "Often mis-sold as MDMA / “molly,” but it is pharmacologically a reuptake blocker — longer, more stimulant and anxiogenic, and more dangerous on an empathogen-style redose." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "常被冒充为 MDMA／“molly”出售，但其药理上是再摄取抑制剂——作用更持久、更偏兴奋和致焦虑，按 empathogen 方式追加剂量时更危险。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "常被冒充為 MDMA／「molly」出售，但其藥理上是再攝取抑制劑——作用更持久、更偏興奮和致焦慮，按 empathogen 方式追加劑量時更危險。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "OK" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
