            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "開"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On a fixed schedule, each dose lands on the tail of the last and the level climbs until intake and clearance balance — steady state." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "按固定间隔用药时，每一剂都叠加在上一剂的尾部，体内水平不断上升，直到摄入与清除达到平衡——即稳态。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "按固定間隔用藥時，每一劑都疊加在上一劑的尾部，體內水平不斷上升，直到攝入與清除達到平衡——即穩態。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
