    "Phenytoin" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "苯妥英"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "苯妥英"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Phenytoin is hydroxylated by a saturable liver enzyme system (CYP2C9/CYP2C19). Because its Km lies below the therapeutic range, dose and level are not proportional: titrate in small steps and confirm with blood levels. CYP2C9/2C19 poor metabolizers, age, and interacting drugs shift the knee lower. Shown as relative shape — phenytoin is individualized by therapeutic drug monitoring." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "苯妥英由一套可饱和的肝酶系统（CYP2C9/CYP2C19）羟基化代谢。由于其 Km 低于治疗范围，剂量与血药水平并不成正比：应小幅调整剂量并通过血药浓度确认。CYP2C9/2C19 慢代谢者、年龄以及相互作用的药物都会使拐点提前。此处仅显示相对形状——苯妥英需通过治疗药物监测进行个体化调整。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "苯妥英由一套可飽和的肝酶系統（CYP2C9/CYP2C19）羥基化代謝。由於其 Km 低於治療範圍，劑量與血藥水平並不成正比：應小幅調整劑量並透過血藥濃度確認。CYP2C9/2C19 慢代謝者、年齡以及相互作用的藥物都會使拐點提前。此處僅顯示相對形狀——苯妥英需透過治療藥物監測進行個體化調整。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
