          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reversed withdrawal scores and craving vs oxazepam taper and placebo. Inpatient IV only — dangerous in chronic users (precipitated withdrawal)." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "逆转了戒断评分和渴求（对比奥沙西泮减量和安慰剂）。仅限住院静脉注射——对长期使用者危险（诱发戒断）。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "逆轉了戒斷評分和渴求（對比奧沙西泮減量和安慰劑）。僅限住院靜脈注射——對長期使用者危險（誘發戒斷）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reverses the transporters to pump monoamines out (substrate efflux) — the MDMA/amphetamine-type mechanism." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "逆转转运体方向，将单胺类递质泵出细胞（底物外排）——即 MDMA／苯丙胺类的作用机制。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "逆轉轉運體方向，將單胺類遞質泵出細胞（底物外排）——即 MDMA／安非他命類的作用機制。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reversible Inhibitor of Monoamine Oxidase A (RIMA)" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "可逆性单胺氧化酶 A 抑制剂 (RIMA)"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "可逆性單胺氧化酶 A 抑制劑 (RIMA)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reversibly inhibits cyclooxygenase enzymes COX-1 and COX-2, reducing the synthesis of prostaglandins from arachidonic acid. COX-2 inhibition mediates anti-inflammatory and analgesic effects, while COX-1 inhibition reduces gastric mucosal protection. Central prostaglandin inhibition contributes to antipyretic effects." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "可逆地抑制环氧合酶 COX-1 和 COX-2,减少花生四烯酸合成前列腺素。COX-2 抑制介导抗炎和镇痛效应,而 COX-1 抑制减少胃黏膜保护。中枢前列腺素抑制助长退热效应。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "可逆地抑制環氧合酶 COX-1 和 COX-2,減少花生四烯酸合成前列腺素。COX-2 抑制介導抗炎和鎮痛效應,而 COX-1 抑制減少胃黏膜保護。中樞前列腺素抑制助長退熱效應。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reverts to the average-adult default (60 kg). Estimates will be marked estimated." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "恢复为普通成年人的默认值（60 kg）。估算结果将标注为估算。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "恢復為普通成年人的預設值（60 kg）。估算結果將標註為估算。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reward is gated by rate" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "奖赏受上升速率闸控"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "獎賞受上升速率閘控"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reward is multiplied by a gate that integrates how fast dopamine is rising. A substance can occupy the transporter fully and still register almost no reward if it arrived slowly — the same pharmacology reading as therapeutic or as euphoric depending on speed alone." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "奖赏会乘上一个闸门，该闸门对多巴胺上升的速率进行积分。若到达缓慢，某物质即便完全占据转运体也几乎产生不了奖赏——同样的药理学，仅因速度不同，就可读作治疗性或欣快性。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "獎賞會乘上一個閘門，該閘門對多巴胺上升的速率進行積分。若到達緩慢，某物質即便完全佔據轉運體也幾乎產生不了獎賞——同樣的藥理學，僅因速度不同，就可讀作治療性或欣快性。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Rich" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "详尽"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "詳盡"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Rifampicin" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "利福平"
          }
