    "SSRI and 5-HT1A Partial Agonist" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "SSRI 兼 5-HT1A 部分激动剂"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "SSRI 兼 5-HT1A 部分激動劑"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SSRIs blunt MDMA — it may feel much weaker or not work. On their own they don't cause serotonin syndrome (the real risk there is MAOIs)." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "SSRI 会减弱 MDMA 的效果——可能明显变弱甚至无效。两者单独合用不会引起血清素综合征（真正的风险来自 MAOI）。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "SSRI 會減弱 MDMA 的效果——可能明顯變弱甚至無效。兩者單獨併用不會引起血清素症候群（真正的風險來自 MAOI）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SSRIs blunt MDMA — it may feel much weaker or not work. On their own they don't cause serotonin syndrome." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "SSRI 会减弱 MDMA 的效果——可能明显变弱甚至无效。两者单独合用不会引起血清素综合征。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "SSRI 會減弱 MDMA 的效果——可能明顯變弱甚至無效。兩者單獨併用不會引起血清素症候群。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SSRIs inhibit TCA metabolism — risk of TCA toxicity and serotonin syndrome." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "SSRI 抑制 TCA 代谢 — 有 TCA 中毒和血清素综合征的风险。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "SSRI 抑制 TCA 代謝 — 有 TCA 中毒和血清素綜合徵的風險。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SSRIs typically reduce psychedelic effects but may increase risk with some compounds." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "SSRI 通常会减弱致幻效应,但与某些化合物可能增加风险。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "SSRI 通常會減弱致幻效應,但與某些化合物可能增加風險。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SSRIs usually blunt MDMA — it may feel much weaker, so people often redose into trouble (overheating, heart strain). On their own they don't cause serotonin syndrome." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "SSRI 通常会减弱 MDMA 的效果——可能明显变弱，于是人们常常追加剂量而出问题（过热、心脏负担）。两者单独合用不会引起血清素综合征。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "SSRI 通常會減弱 MDMA 的效果——可能明顯變弱，於是人們常常追加劑量而出問題（過熱、心臟負擔）。兩者單獨併用不會引起血清素症候群。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SSRIs, SNRIs, and MAOIs." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "SSRI、SNRI 与 MAOI。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "SSRI、SNRI 與 MAOI。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "St John's Wort" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "圣约翰草"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "聖約翰草"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "St John's Wort induces CYP3A4, lowering the levels of drugs cleared by it (magnitude varies by product)." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "圣约翰草诱导 CYP3A4，降低经该酶清除的药物的血药浓度（强度因产品而异）。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "聖約翰草誘導 CYP3A4，降低經該酶清除的藥物的血藥濃度（強度因產品而異）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stabilizes neuronal membranes by blocking voltage-gated sodium channels in their inactivated state, reducing sustained repetitive firing. Preferentially reduces glutamate release rather than GABA release, distinguishing it from other sodium channel blockers and potentially accounting for its mood-stabilizing properties, particularly in preventing depressive episodes in bipolar disorder." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "通过在失活态阻断电压门控钠通道稳定神经元膜,减少持续重复放电。优先减少谷氨酸释放而非 GABA 释放,这使其与其他钠通道阻滞剂有所不同,可能解释了其情绪稳定特性,特别是在预防双相情感障碍的抑郁发作方面。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "透過在失活態阻斷電壓門控鈉通道穩定神經元膜,減少持續重複放電。優先減少麩胺酸釋放而非 GABA 釋放,這使其與其他鈉通道阻滯劑有所不同,可能解釋了其情緒穩定特性,特別是在預防雙相情感障礙的鬱期方面。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stable ~%@ days once reconstituted" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "复溶后约可稳定 %@ 天"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "復溶後約可穩定 %@ 天"
          }
        }
      }
    },
