        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "陡峭、超線性——以文字說明（缺乏可靠的人體動力學數據）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Steep, supralinear — described, not drawn (no reliable human kinetics)." : {
