    "Stimulant" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "兴奋剂"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "興奮劑"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stimulant tolerance isn't one number you can multiply a dose by. The fast part is within a session (a redose lands weaker); the slow part is a months-long recovery state, not a “take more” signal." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "兴奋剂耐受不是一个可用来乘剂量的数字。快的部分发生在同一次使用内（再次用药效果更弱）；慢的部分是长达数月的恢复状态，而非“该多用”的信号。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "興奮劑耐受不是一個可用來乘劑量的數字。快的部分發生在同一次使用內（再次用藥效果更弱）；慢的部分是長達數月的恢復狀態，而非「該多用」的訊號。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stimulants" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "兴奋剂"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "興奮劑"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stimulants (DAT/NET)" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "兴奋剂（DAT/NET）"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "興奮劑（DAT/NET）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stimulants mask alcohol impairment — risk of overconsumption." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "兴奋剂会掩盖酒精损害 — 有过量饮用的风险。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "興奮劑會掩蓋酒精損害 — 有過量飲用的風險。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stimulants mask overdose signs — when they wear off, respiratory depression can emerge." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "兴奋剂会掩盖过量的征兆 — 一旦消退,呼吸抑制可能浮现。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "興奮劑會掩蓋過量的徵兆 — 一旦消退,呼吸抑制可能浮現。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
