    "That preset already exists." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "该预设已存在。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "該預設已存在。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That's a high cumulative dose. %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这是较高的累积剂量。%@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "這是較高的累積劑量。%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That's everything today — %lld days and counting." : {

    },
    "That's everything today." : {

    },
    "The active compound salvinorin A is a structurally unique non-nitrogenous terpenoid that acts as a highly potent and selective agonist at κ-opioid receptors (KOR). Unlike virtually all other known psychoactive compounds, it has no significant activity at serotonin 5-HT2A receptors. KOR activation in the claustrum and prefrontal cortex produces intensely dissociative and hallucinatory effects." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "活性化合物鼠尾草素 A 是一种结构独特的非氮萜类化合物,作为高效且选择性的 κ-阿片受体 (KOR) 激动剂。与几乎所有其他已知精神活性化合物不同,对血清素 5-HT2A 受体无显著活性。屏状核和前额叶皮质中的 KOR 激活产生强烈的解离和致幻效应。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "活性化合物鼠尾草素 A 是一種結構獨特的非氮萜類化合物,作為高效且選擇性的 κ-阿片受體 (KOR) 激動劑。與幾乎所有其他已知精神活性化合物不同,對血清素 5-HT2A 受體無顯著活性。屏狀核和前額葉皮質中的 KOR 激活產生強烈的解離和致幻效應。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The amount that counts as a full supply for the bar. Set to 0 to hide the bar." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "作为进度条满量基准的数量。设为 0 可隐藏进度条。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "作為進度條滿量基準的數量。設為 0 可隱藏進度條。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The calculation, step by step" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "逐步拆解计算过程"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "逐步拆解計算過程"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The carrier is already saturating across the normal dose range: bioavailability falls from ~60% at 900 mg/day to ~27% at 4800 mg/day, so each step up buys progressively less." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在常用剂量范围内该载体就已趋于饱和：生物利用度从 900 mg/日 时的约 60% 降至 4800 mg/日 时的约 27%，因此每加大一档，获益越来越少。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在常用劑量範圍內該載體就已趨於飽和：生物利用度從 900 mg/日 時的約 60% 降至 4800 mg/日 時的約 27%，因此每加大一檔，獲益越來越少。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The clearing enzyme is already half-saturated inside the normal dose range, so a small dose increase near the top can roughly double the level into toxicity." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在正常剂量范围内，清除它的酶就已经半饱和，因此在范围上限附近，剂量稍有增加就可能使血药水平大致翻倍，进入中毒区间。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在正常劑量範圍內，清除它的酶就已經半飽和，因此在範圍上限附近，劑量稍有增加就可能使血藥水平大致翻倍，進入中毒區間。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The comedown" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "退效期"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "退效期"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The comedown here is over-compensation plus a depletion debt — not dopamine falling below baseline." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此处的退药反应是代偿过度加上耗竭亏空——并非多巴胺跌破基线。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此處的退藥反應是代償過度加上耗竭虧空——並非多巴胺跌破基線。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The concentration unit these values use. Lower numbers always mean the drug works at smaller amounts." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这些数值所用的浓度单位。数字越小，表示药物在更低的量下就能起作用。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "這些數值所用的濃度單位。數字越小，表示藥物在更低的量下就能起作用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The crash is your nervous system demanding rest and replenishment." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这次崩溃是您的神经系统在要求休息和补充。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "這次崩潰是您的神經系統在要求休息和補充。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The DAT:NET:SERT potency ratios are taken from one published assay, chosen by coverage and confidence, never mixed across labs. Only ratios measured in the same experiment are physically comparable." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "DAT:NET:SERT 的效价比取自同一篇已发表的实验，依覆盖度与可信度择优，绝不跨实验室混用。只有在同一实验中测得的比值才具有物理可比性。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "DAT:NET:SERT 的效價比取自同一篇已發表的實驗，依覆蓋度與可信度擇優，絕不跨實驗室混用。只有在同一實驗中測得的比值才具有物理可比性。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The databases and primary literature behind this compound's data. Tap to open; always verify against the original source." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "本化合物数据背后的数据库与原始文献。点按打开；请始终对照原始来源核实。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "本化合物資料背後的資料庫與原始文獻。點按開啟；請始終對照原始來源核實。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The desmethyl metabolite shifts clomipramine's strongly serotonergic action toward noradrenaline, so the two don't act quite alike — the balance moves as the metabolite accumulates." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "去甲基代谢物将氯丙咪嗪强烈的血清素能作用向去甲肾上腺素方向转移,因此两者的作用并不完全相同——随着代谢物蓄积,平衡发生变化。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "去甲基代謝物將氯丙咪嗪強烈的血清素能作用向去甲腎上腺素方向轉移,因此兩者的作用並不完全相同——隨著代謝物蓄積,平衡發生變化。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The discomfort peaks and then fades. Give it time." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "不适会达到顶峰然后消退。给它时间。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "不適會達到頂峰然後消退。給它時間。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The dose that no longer makes you sleepy impairs your memory and coordination exactly as much as it did on day one." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "不再让你困倦的剂量对你的记忆和协调能力的损害与第一天完全相同。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "不再讓你困倦的劑量對你的記憶和協調能力的損害與第一天完全相同。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The engine can simulate these as part of a plan, but they need a calibrated substance in the same plan to anchor the curve." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "引擎可以在方案中模拟这些物质，但同一方案中需要有一种已校准的物质来锚定曲线。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "引擎可以在方案中模擬這些物質，但同一方案中需要有一種已校準的物質來錨定曲線。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The exact amount you have now. Changing it is logged as a correction." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你当前的确切数量。修改后会记录为一次校正。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你目前的確切數量。修改後會記錄為一次校正。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The fast gap is the rush. Because the fast signal catches up within minutes, that gap is effectively proportional to how quickly dopamine rose. The slow gap is the high while it stays positive; once the slow expectation overshoots the falling dopamine, the same term turns into part of the comedown." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "快速差距就是冲劲。由于快速信号在数分钟内即可追平，该差距实际上与多巴胺上升的速度成正比。缓慢差距在为正时即是高峰体验；一旦缓慢预期超过了正在下落的多巴胺，同一项便转为退药反应的一部分。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "快速差距就是衝勁。由於快速訊號在數分鐘內即可追平，該差距實際上與多巴胺上升的速度成正比。緩慢差距在為正時即是高峰體驗；一旦緩慢預期超過了正在下落的多巴胺，同一項便轉為退藥反應的一部分。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The file has an empty value for a required field: %@." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "文件的必需字段为空值：%@。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "檔案的必要欄位為空值：%@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The file has an unexpected value at: %@." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "文件在此处包含意外的值：%@。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "檔案在此處包含非預期的值：%@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The file is missing a required field: %@." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "文件缺少必需字段：%@。"
          }
