            "value" : "檔案不是有效的 JSON。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The foggy feeling will clear. Give it hours, not minutes." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "迷糊感会消散。需要数小时,而非数分钟。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "迷糊感會消散。需要數小時,而非數分鐘。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The foggy feeling will clear. Give it hours." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "迷糊感会消散。需要数小时。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "迷糊感會消散。需要數小時。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The four readouts" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "四项读数"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "四項讀數"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The groups within it" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "其中的分类"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "其中的分類"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Half-Life Calculator models one dose fading out. A dose repeated on a schedule instead lands on the tail of the last, and the level climbs until intake and clearance balance — steady state." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "半衰期计算器模拟单次剂量的消退。而按固定间隔重复用药时，每一剂都叠加在上一剂的尾部，体内水平不断上升，直到摄入与清除达到平衡——这就是稳态。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "半衰期計算器模擬單次劑量的消退。而按固定間隔重複用藥時，每一劑都疊加在上一劑的尾部，體內水平不斷上升，直到攝入與清除達到平衡——這就是穩態。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The high fades with tolerance, but the load on your heart and blood pressure doesn't." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "兴奋感会随耐受减弱，但对心脏和血压的负担不会。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "興奮感會隨耐受減弱，但對心臟和血壓的負擔不會。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The highest concentration reached in the blood after a dose." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "一次用药后血液中达到的最高浓度。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "一次用藥後血液中達到的最高濃度。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The idea" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "原理"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "原理"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The idea first, then every stage from your dose to the line on the chart." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "先讲思路，再逐一拆解从你的剂量到图上那条线的每个阶段。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "先講思路，再逐一拆解從你的劑量到圖上那條線的每個階段。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The immediate biosynthetic precursor to serotonin (5-HT). Crosses the blood-brain barrier and is converted to serotonin by aromatic L-amino acid decarboxylase (AADC). Unlike tryptophan, bypasses the rate-limiting tryptophan hydroxylase step. Increases central serotonin synthesis. Should not be combined with serotonergic medications due to serotonin syndrome risk." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "血清素 (5-HT) 的直接生物合成前体。穿过血脑屏障,由芳香族 L-氨基酸脱羧酶 (AADC) 转化为血清素。与色氨酸不同,绕过限速的色氨酸羟化酶步骤。增加中枢血清素合成。由于血清素综合征风险,不应与血清素能药物合用。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "血清素 (5-HT) 的直接生物合成前體。穿過血腦屏障,由芳香族 L-胺基酸脫羧酶 (AADC) 轉化為血清素。與色胺酸不同,繞過限速的色胺酸羥化酶步驟。增加中樞血清素合成。由於血清素綜合徵風險,不應與血清素能藥物合用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The level settles around %@ a single dose, reaching steady state in about %@." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "体内水平稳定在单次剂量的约 %@，约 %@ 达到稳态。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "體內水平穩定在單次劑量的約 %@，約 %@ 達到穩態。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The limit is set by how much CYP2D6 enzyme you have, not by a specific milligram dose. The analgesic plateau around ~60 mg is a clinical observation, not a kinetic ceiling." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这个上限取决于你拥有多少 CYP2D6 酶，而非某个具体的毫克剂量。约 60 毫克左右的镇痛平台是临床观察结果，并非动力学封顶。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "這個上限取決於你擁有多少 CYP2D6 酶，而非某個具體的毫克劑量。約 60 毫克左右的鎮痛平台是臨床觀察結果，並非動力學封頂。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The limit is set by how much CYP2D6 enzyme you have. The analgesic plateau around ~60 mg is a clinical observation." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这个上限取决于你拥有多少 CYP2D6 酶。约 60 毫克左右的镇痛平台是临床观察结果。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "這個上限取決於你擁有多少 CYP2D6 酶。約 60 毫克左右的鎮痛平台是臨床觀察結果。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The low mood is chemical, not a reflection of reality. It lifts." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "情绪低落源于化学变化,并非现实的反映。它会过去。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "情緒低落源於化學變化,並非現實的反映。它會過去。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The low mood is chemical. It lifts." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "情绪低落源于化学变化。它会过去。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "情緒低落源於化學變化。它會過去。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The low mood is temporary and normal. Eat light foods, stay warm, and rest. Be kind to yourself over the next few days." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "情绪低落是暂时且正常的。吃清淡食物、保暖、休息。接下来几天善待自己。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "情緒低落是暫時且正常的。吃清淡食物、保暖、休息。接下來幾天善待自己。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The mix adds cardiovascular strain beyond either alone, and the ethylphenidate it forms outlasts the methylphenidate itself, so the load on your heart is stretched out rather than added up." : {

    },
    "The model anchors on five stimulants — amphetamine, methylphenidate, mephedrone, 3-MMC, 2-MMC. Add one of those (or a brand of it) and the others will shape the curves around it." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "该模型以五种兴奋剂为基准——安非他明、哌甲酯、4-甲基甲卡西酮、3-MMC、2-MMC。添加其中之一（或它的品牌药），其他物质便会围绕它塑造曲线。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "該模型以五種興奮劑為基準——安非他命、哌甲酯、4-甲基甲卡西酮、3-MMC、2-MMC。加入其中之一（或它的品牌藥），其他物質便會圍繞它塑造曲線。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The model is calibrated on a single substance taken once, in lab conditions. The interactions here stay mechanistic, but each extra dose and substance adds parameters and widens the margin of error." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "该模型是在实验室条件下，基于单一物质单次摄入校准的。这里的相互作用仍是机制性的，但每增加一次用量或一种物质都会引入更多参数，扩大误差范围。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此模型是在實驗室條件下，基於單一物質單次攝入校準的。這裡的交互作用仍是機制性的，但每增加一次用量或一種物質都會引入更多參數，擴大誤差範圍。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The model is calibrated on five stimulants: amphetamine, methylphenidate, mephedrone, 3-MMC, and 2-MMC. Other substances shape the curves through how they interact with these. Opioids are read through their dopamine activity, mostly to show those interactions." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "该模型基于五种兴奋剂校准：安非他明、哌甲酯、4-甲基甲卡西酮、3-MMC 和 2-MMC。其他物质通过与它们的相互作用来影响曲线。阿片类物质则依据其多巴胺活性来解读，主要用于呈现这些相互作用。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此模型基於五種興奮劑校準：安非他命、哌甲酯、4-甲基甲卡西酮、3-MMC 和 2-MMC。其他物質透過與它們的交互作用來影響曲線。鴉片類物質則依據其多巴胺活性來解讀，主要用於呈現這些交互作用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The model was calibrated on these. Each one can be modeled on its own." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "模型以这些物质为基准校准，每一种都可单独模拟。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "模型以這些物質為基準校準，每一種都可單獨模擬。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The old “never mix” warning is largely a medical myth — large reviews found no real harm. Both still strain the heart, so it isn't a green light to combine them." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“绝不可同用”的旧说法在很大程度上是医学误区——大型综述未发现真正的危害。但两者都会增加心脏负担，因此也并非可以随意同用。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "「絕不可同用」的舊說法在很大程度上是醫學迷思——大型綜述未發現真正的危害。但兩者都會增加心臟負擔，因此也並非可以隨意同用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The original symptoms return — the thing the drug was treating comes back." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "原有症状重新出现——药物本来在治疗的问题又回来了。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "原有症狀重新出現——藥物本來在治療的問題又回來了。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The original symptoms return, briefly stronger than before." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "原有症状重新出现，并在短期内比之前更强。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "原有症狀重新出現，並在短期內比之前更強。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The primary alkaloid in kratom. Acts as a partial agonist at μ-opioid receptors (MOR), producing dose-dependent analgesic and euphoric effects. At lower doses, stimulant-like effects are attributed to α2-adrenergic agonism and 5-HT2A antagonism. The metabolite 7-hydroxymitragynine has significantly higher MOR potency. Also acts as a κ-opioid receptor antagonist." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "克拉通中的主要生物碱。作为 μ-阿片受体 (MOR) 的部分激动剂,产生剂量依赖的镇痛和欣快效应。在较低剂量下,类兴奋剂效应归因于 α2-肾上腺素激动和 5-HT2A 拮抗。代谢物 7-羟基米屈格宁的 MOR 效力显著更高。也作为 κ-阿片受体拮抗剂。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "克拉通中的主要生物鹼。作為 μ-阿片受體 (MOR) 的部分激動劑,產生劑量依賴的鎮痛和欣快效應。在較低劑量下,類興奮劑效應歸因於 α2-腎上腺素激動和 5-HT2A 拮抗。代謝物 7-羥基米屈格寧的 MOR 效力顯著更高。也作為 κ-阿片受體拮抗劑。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The primary alkaloid mitragynine acts as a partial agonist at μ-opioid receptors (MOR), producing dose-dependent analgesic and euphoric effects. At lower doses, stimulant-like effects are attributed to α2-adrenergic agonism and 5-HT2A antagonism. The metabolite 7-hydroxymitragynine has significantly higher MOR potency. Unlike classical opioids, mitragynine also acts as a κ-opioid receptor antagonist." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "主要生物碱米屈格宁作为 μ-阿片受体 (MOR) 的部分激动剂,产生剂量依赖的镇痛和欣快效应。在较低剂量下,类兴奋剂效应归因于 α2-肾上腺素激动和 5-HT2A 拮抗。代谢物 7-羟基米屈格宁的 MOR 效力显著更高。与经典阿片不同,米屈格宁也作为 κ-阿片受体拮抗剂。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "主要生物鹼米屈格寧作為 μ-阿片受體 (MOR) 的部分激動劑,產生劑量依賴的鎮痛和欣快效應。在較低劑量下,類興奮劑效應歸因於 α2-腎上腺素激動和 5-HT2A 拮抗。代謝物 7-羥基米屈格寧的 MOR 效力顯著更高。與經典阿片不同,米屈格寧也作為 κ-阿片受體拮抗劑。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The protocol below reflects community or investigational use, not validated human dosing or medical advice. Many of these compounds are WADA-prohibited and lack human safety data." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "下方方案反映社区或试验性用途，并非经过验证的人体剂量或医疗建议。其中许多化合物被 WADA 禁用，且缺乏人体安全数据。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "下方方案反映社群或試驗性用途，並非經過驗證的人體劑量或醫療建議。其中許多化合物被 WADA 禁用，且缺乏人體安全數據。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The R-enantiomer of modafinil with the same mechanism: weak DAT inhibition, orexin/hypocretin neuron activation, and histamine release promotion. Has a longer effective half-life than racemic modafinil, providing more sustained wakefulness-promoting effects throughout the day." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "莫达非尼的 R-对映体,机制相同:弱 DAT 抑制、促醒素/食欲素神经元激活,以及组胺释放促进。有效半衰期比外消旋莫达非尼更长,全天提供更持续的促醒效应。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "莫達非尼的 R-對映體,機制相同:弱 DAT 抑制、促醒素/食慾素神經元激活,以及組胺釋放促進。有效半衰期比消旋莫達非尼更長,全天提供更持續的促醒效應。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The rest of the family" : {
      "comment" : "Header above the sibling drug classes",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "同类其他药物"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "同類其他藥物"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The same dose hits harder the less you weigh. Set yours so estimates fit your body — otherwise Piru assumes an average adult, about 60 kg." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "体重越轻，同样的剂量作用越强。设置你的体重，让估算贴合你的身体——否则 Piru 会按普通成年人（约 60 公斤）计算。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "體重越輕，同樣的劑量作用越強。設定你的體重，讓估算貼合你的身體——否則 Piru 會按普通成年人（約 60 公斤）計算。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The same Health connection also lets Piru show your heart rate and blood pressure on each session — off until you turn it on in Settings." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "同一“健康”连接还能让 Piru 在每次记录中显示你的心率和血压——在你于“设置”中开启前将保持关闭。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "同一「健康」連線還能讓 Piru 在每次記錄中顯示你的心率和血壓——在你於「設定」中開啟前將保持關閉。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The same Health connection also switches on your heart rate and blood pressure on each session — you can turn that off anytime in Settings." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "同一“健康”连接还会在每次记录中开启你的心率和血压显示——可随时在“设置”中关闭。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "同一「健康」連線還會在每次記錄中開啟你的心率和血壓顯示——可隨時在「設定」中關閉。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The shaded gap is what you feel. As dopamine fades and the expectation lags above it, that gap turns into the comedown." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "阴影区域即是你的感受。当多巴胺消退、预期滞留于其上时，这段落差便转为退效期。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "陰影區域即是你的感受。當多巴胺消退、預期滯留於其上時，這段落差便轉為退效期。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The share that rides along stuck to blood proteins. Only the unbound rest is free to act." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "附着在血浆蛋白上随之运行的比例。只有未结合的那部分才能发挥作用。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "附著在血漿蛋白上隨之運行的比例。只有未結合的那部分才能發揮作用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The sleep effect tolerizes" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "助眠效果会产生耐受"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "助眠效果會產生耐受"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The slow axis here is a recovery-state indicator, not an effect multiplier." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这里的慢轴是一个恢复状态指标，而不是效果乘数。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "這裡的慢軸是一個恢復狀態指標，而不是效果乘數。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The slow change here is a SERT-binding association, reversible-leaning — not proven neurotoxicity, and not a dose multiplier. It's a recovery-state indicator." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这里的慢变化是一种 SERT 结合关联，倾向可逆——并非已证实的神经毒性，也不是剂量乘数。它是一个恢复状态指标。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "這裡的慢變化是一種 SERT 結合關聯，傾向可逆——並非已證實的神經毒性，也不是劑量乘數。它是一個恢復狀態指標。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The strongest result in the literature. Discontinuation significantly higher than taper alone at both 3 months and 6–12 months." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "文献中最强的结果。停药率在3个月和6–12个月时均显著高于单纯减量。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "文獻中最強的結果。停藥率在3個月和6–12個月時均顯著高於單純減量。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The target opioid can't be linearly converted — see the note below." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "目标阿片无法进行线性换算——请参见下方说明。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "目標阿片無法進行線性換算——請參見下方說明。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The time for your body to clear half of what's left. It takes about five half-lives to clear almost all of it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "身体清除掉其中一半所需的时间。大约经过五个半衰期才能几乎完全清除。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "身體清除掉其中一半所需的時間。大約經過五個半衰期才能幾乎完全清除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There are no ads and no trackers. Your data is yours alone." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "没有广告，也没有追踪器。你的数据只属于你。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "沒有廣告，也沒有追蹤器。你的資料只屬於你。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There is no fixed milligram knee — the limit (or its absence) is set by your CYP2D6 activity. Poor metabolizers get little opioid effect but keep tramadol's serotonin/seizure risk; ultra-rapid metabolizers blow past the usual ceiling." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "并不存在固定的毫克拐点——其上限（或没有上限）取决于你的 CYP2D6 活性。慢代谢者获得的阿片效应很弱，却仍保留曲马多的 5-羟色胺／癫痫风险；超快代谢者则会突破通常的封顶。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "並不存在固定的毫克拐點——其上限（或沒有上限）取決於你的 CYP2D6 活性。慢代謝者獲得的鴉片效應很弱，卻仍保留曲馬多的 5-羥色胺／癲癇風險；超快代謝者則會突破通常的封頂。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These appear in the “When” menu when logging a dose, alongside Now and the full date picker. Swipe to remove, drag to reorder." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "记录用药时，这些会显示在“时间”菜单中，与“现在”和完整日期选择器并列。左滑删除，拖动重新排序。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "記錄用藥時，這些會顯示在「時間」選單中，與「現在」和完整日期選擇器並列。左滑刪除，拖曳重新排序。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These are model predictions of how repeated use changes each receptor — never a measurement. Each figure carries a confidence tier." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这些是模型对反复使用如何改变各受体的预测——绝非实测。每个数字都附有置信等级。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "這些是模型對反覆使用如何改變各受體的預測——絕非實測。每個數字都附有置信等級。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These are model predictions of how repeated use changes each receptor's responsiveness — never a measurement. Tolerance is shown per mechanism, because one universal “tolerance %” is wrong for some classes (stimulants especially)." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这些是模型对反复使用如何改变各受体反应性的预测——并非实测。耐受性按机制分别显示，因为单一通用的“耐受性百分比”对某些类别（尤其是兴奋剂）是错误的。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "這些是模型對反覆使用如何改變各受體反應性的預測——並非實測。耐受性按機制分別顯示，因為單一通用的「耐受性百分比」對某些類別（尤其是興奮劑）是錯誤的。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These are population averages from research — your own values vary with genetics, body size, and how the drug is taken." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这些是研究得出的群体平均值——你的实际数值会因遗传、体型以及用药方式而不同。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "這些是研究得出的群體平均值——你的實際數值會因遺傳、體型以及用藥方式而不同。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These curves are built from %@. %@ sit outside the model." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这些曲线基于 %@ 构建。%@ 不在模型范围内。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "這些曲線基於 %@ 構建。%@ 不在模型範圍內。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These curves estimate how this session may feel over time — how effects rise, peak, and fade, and how strong they get. Redoses and each substance's full duration are included, so a bigger dose lifts the curve higher." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这些曲线估算本次记录随时间可能的感受——效应如何上升、达到峰值、消退，以及强度如何。追加剂量和每种物质的完整作用时长都已纳入，因此剂量越大，曲线越高。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "這些曲線估算本次記錄隨時間可能的感受——效應如何上升、達到峰值、消退，以及強度如何。追加劑量和每種物質的完整作用時長都已納入，因此劑量越大，曲線越高。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These effects are proportional to how much and how often you've been using." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这些影响与您使用的剂量和频率成正比。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "這些影響與您使用的劑量和頻率成正比。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These notes will appear at the end of the PDF report." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这些备注将出现在 PDF 报告末尾。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "這些備註將出現在 PDF 報告末尾。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These oral factors don't cover every route or product. Transdermal, buccal, and IV forms differ." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这些口服换算系数并不涵盖所有给药途径或剂型。透皮、口颊和静脉剂型各不相同。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "這些口服換算係數並不涵蓋所有給藥途徑或劑型。透皮、口頰和靜脈劑型各不相同。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These values were not measured together — each is its own study. Ranked here for scale, not as a league table." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这些数值并非在同一实验中测得——每个都来自各自的研究。此处排列只为呈现量级，不是排行榜。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "這些數值並非在同一實驗中測得——每個都來自各自的研究。此處排列只為呈現量級，不是排行榜。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These values were not measured together — each is its own study. Ranked here for scale." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这些数值并非在同一实验中测得——每个都来自各自的研究。此处排列只为呈现量级。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "這些數值並非在同一實驗中測得——每個都來自各自的研究。此處排列只為呈現量級。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This backup uses a newer format (v%lld) than this version of Piru understands. Please update the app." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此备份使用的格式（v%lld）比当前 Piru 版本更新。请更新应用。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此備份使用的格式（v%lld）比目前 Piru 版本更新。請更新 App。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This calculator uses a one-compartment oral pharmacokinetic model with absorption and elimination phases. Absorption rates are estimated from known duration profiles (onset + comeup timing) when available, or use a default 4× elimination rate ratio. Population-average elimination half-lives are sourced from FDA-approved prescribing information, published pharmacokinetic studies (PubMed), and DrugBank. Half-lives for some research chemicals and novel substances are estimated from structurally similar compounds and may be less reliable.\n\nReal pharmacokinetics vary significantly based on individual metabolism, genetics, liver and kidney function, body composition, age, drug interactions, tolerance, and route of administration. Multi-compartment distribution, protein binding, active metabolites, and enterohepatic recirculation are not accounted for. Polydrug use may alter elimination rates unpredictably.\n\nThese figures are approximate population averages — not a substitute for clinical monitoring or professional medical advice. Always consult a qualified healthcare professional." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此计算器使用一房室口服药代动力学模型,包含吸收和消除两个阶段。如有已知的持续时间数据(起效 + 上升期),则吸收速率会由此估算;否则使用默认的 4× 消除速率比。群体平均消除半衰期来源于 FDA 批准的处方信息、已发表的药代动力学研究(PubMed)以及 DrugBank。部分研究化学品和新型物质的半衰期是根据结构类似的化合物估算的,可能不够可靠。\n\n实际药代动力学因个人代谢、遗传、肝肾功能、体成分、年龄、药物相互作用、耐受性和给药途径而显著不同。多房室分布、蛋白结合、活性代谢物和肠肝循环未被纳入考虑。多药联用可能不可预测地改变消除速率。\n\n这些数字是群体的近似平均值 — 不能替代临床监测或专业医疗建议。请始终咨询合格的医疗专业人员。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此計算器使用一房室口服藥動學模型,包含吸收和消除兩個階段。如有已知的持續時間資料(起效 + 上升期),則吸收速率會由此估算;否則使用預設的 4× 消除速率比。族群平均消除半衰期來源於 FDA 批准的處方資訊、已發表的藥動學研究(PubMed)以及 DrugBank。部分研究化學品和新型物質的半衰期是根據結構類似的化合物估算的,可能不夠可靠。\n\n實際藥動學因個人代謝、遺傳、肝腎功能、體成分、年齡、藥物相互作用、耐受性和給藥途徑而顯著不同。多房室分布、蛋白質結合、活性代謝物和腸肝循環未被納入考慮。多藥聯用可能不可預測地改變消除速率。\n\n這些數字是族群的近似平均值 — 不能替代臨床監測或專業醫療建議。請始終諮詢合格的醫療專業人員。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This calculator uses a one-compartment oral pharmacokinetic model with absorption and elimination phases. Absorption rates are estimated from known duration profiles (onset + comeup timing) when available, or use a default 4× elimination rate ratio. Population-average elimination half-lives are sourced from FDA-approved prescribing information, published pharmacokinetic studies (PubMed), DrugBank, and established pharmacology references (Goodman & Gilman's, Stahl's Essential Psychopharmacology). Half-lives for some research chemicals and novel substances are estimated from structurally similar compounds and may be less reliable.\n\nReal pharmacokinetics vary significantly based on individual metabolism, genetics, liver and kidney function, body composition, age, drug interactions, tolerance, and route of administration. Multi-compartment distribution, protein binding, active metabolites, and enterohepatic recirculation are not accounted for. Polydrug use may alter elimination rates unpredictably.\n\nThese figures are approximate population averages — not a substitute for clinical monitoring or professional medical advice. Always consult a qualified healthcare professional." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此计算器使用一房室口服药代动力学模型,包含吸收和消除两个阶段。如有已知的持续时间数据(起效 + 上升期),则吸收速率会由此估算;否则使用默认的 4× 消除速率比。群体平均消除半衰期来源于 FDA 批准的处方信息、已发表的药代动力学研究(PubMed)、DrugBank 以及成熟的药理学参考资料(《古德曼&吉尔曼治疗学的药理学基础》、《Stahl 精神药理学精要》)。部分研究化学品和新型物质的半衰期是根据结构类似的化合物估算的,可能不够可靠。\n\n实际药代动力学因个人代谢、遗传、肝肾功能、体成分、年龄、药物相互作用、耐受性和给药途径而显著不同。多房室分布、蛋白结合、活性代谢物和肠肝循环未被纳入考虑。多药联用可能不可预测地改变消除速率。\n\n这些数字是群体的近似平均值 — 不能替代临床监测或专业医疗建议。请始终咨询合格的医疗专业人员。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此計算器使用一房室口服藥動學模型,包含吸收和消除兩個階段。如有已知的持續時間資料(起效 + 上升期),則吸收速率會由此估算;否則使用預設的 4× 消除速率比。族群平均消除半衰期來源於 FDA 批准的處方資訊、已發表的藥動學研究(PubMed)、DrugBank 以及成熟的藥理學參考資料(《古德曼&吉爾曼治療學的藥理學基礎》、《Stahl 精神藥理學精要》)。部分研究化學品和新型物質的半衰期是根據結構類似的化合物估算的,可能不夠可靠。\n\n實際藥動學因個人代謝、遺傳、肝腎功能、體成分、年齡、藥物相互作用、耐受性和給藥途徑而顯著不同。多房室分布、蛋白質結合、活性代謝物和腸肝循環未被納入考慮。多藥聯用可能不可預測地改變消除速率。\n\n這些數字是族群的近似平均值 — 不能替代臨床監測或專業醫療建議。請始終諮詢合格的醫療專業人員。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This can entrench a deeper change that takes months to relax. It shows up only well past everyday or therapeutic doses — steady use doesn't reach it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这会留下一种更深的变化，要好几个月才松得下来。它只在远超日常或治疗剂量时才出现——正常用量碰不到它。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "這會留下一種更深的變化，要好幾個月才鬆得下來。它只在遠超日常或治療劑量時才出現——正常用量碰不到它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This ceiling is on the opioid effect only — not on codeine's other risks. Two big caveats: “ultra-rapid metabolizers” convert far more codeine to morphine and can reach dangerous levels at ordinary doses (the FDA contraindicates codeine in them), while “poor metabolizers” get little relief. So this is not a green light to take more." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这个封顶只针对阿片效应——并不涵盖可待因的其他风险。两点重要提醒：“超快代谢者”会把多得多的可待因转化为吗啡，在普通剂量下就可能达到危险水平（FDA 对这类人群禁用可待因），而“慢代谢者”几乎得不到缓解。所以这并不是可以多服的许可。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "這個封頂只針對阿片效應——並不涵蓋可待因的其他風險。兩點重要提醒：“超快代謝者”會把多得多的可待因轉化為嗎啡，在普通劑量下就可能達到危險水平（FDA 對這類人群禁用可待因），而“慢代謝者”幾乎得不到緩解。所以這並不是可以多服的許可。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This class isn’t in the library anymore." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此类别已不在物质库中。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此類別已不在物質庫中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This compound has no validated human dose data. Information below is for reference only — see the linked sources for primary literature. Do not extrapolate doses from related compounds." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "该化合物没有经过验证的人体剂量数据。以下信息仅供参考 — 原始文献请参阅所链接的来源。请勿根据相关化合物推算剂量。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "該化合物沒有經過驗證的人體劑量數據。以下資訊僅供參考 — 原始文獻請參閱所連結的來源。請勿根據相關化合物推算劑量。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This converts and compares — it is not a taper schedule. Plan any dose reduction with a clinician." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "本工具用于换算与比较，并非减量方案。任何减量都应与临床医生一起制定。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "本工具用於換算與比較，並非減量方案。任何減量都應與臨床醫師一起制定。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This curve reaches the heavy dose range" : {
      "localizations" : {
