    },
    "Used together" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "同时使用"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "同時使用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Uses the same one-compartment oral model, assuming a regular schedule and linear kinetics. Values are body content in the dose's units, not a plasma concentration. Real accumulation varies with metabolism, dosing gaps, and active metabolites." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "使用相同的单室口服模型，假设规律用药且动力学为线性。数值为以剂量单位表示的体内含量，而非血浆浓度。实际蓄积会因代谢、用药间隔和活性代谢物而异。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "使用相同的單室口服模型，假設規律用藥且動力學為線性。數值為以劑量單位表示的體內含量，而非血漿濃度。實際蓄積會因代謝、用藥間隔和活性代謝物而異。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Using the average 60 kg. Set yours above so estimates fit your body — the same dose hits harder the less you weigh." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "正使用平均值 60 kg。在上方设置你的体重，让估算贴合你自己——越轻，同样的剂量作用越强。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "正使用平均值 60 kg。在上方設定你的體重，讓估算貼合你自己——越輕，同樣的劑量作用越強。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
