            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "健康提醒"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wellness reminders send hydration and sleep nudges automatically. Phase notifications alert you at onset, come-up, and peak — requires a substance with duration data." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "健康提醒会自动发送补水和睡眠提示。阶段通知会在起效、上升期和巅峰时提醒您 — 需要物质具备时长数据。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "健康提醒會自動發送補水和睡眠提示。階段通知會在起效、上升期和巔峰時提醒您 — 需要物質具備時長資料。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What do these mean?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这些是什么意思？"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "這些是什麼意思？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What is this?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这是什么？"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "這是什麼？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What stopping looks like, at the population level — three things people call \"withdrawal\" that behave differently, and roughly when each starts for drugs like the ones you've logged. Timing is from research populations, not a prediction for you." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "从群体层面看停药会怎样——人们所说的“戒断”其实包含三种表现不同的情况，以及对于你记录过的这类药物，每种大约何时开始。这些时间来自研究人群，并非对你个人的预测。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "從群體層面看停藥會怎樣——人們所說的「戒斷」其實包含三種表現不同的情況，以及對於你記錄過的這類藥物，每種大約何時開始。這些時間來自研究人群，並非對你個人的預測。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What the engine uses" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "引擎实际使用的数值"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
