            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "同服 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "With heavy, prolonged use" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "长期大量使用之后"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "長期大量使用之後"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "With regular use, your resting heart rate and blood pressure tend to settle over weeks." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "长期规律使用，你静息时的心率和血压通常会在几周内慢慢回落。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "長期規律使用，你靜息時的心率和血壓通常會在幾週內慢慢回落。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "With repeated use a receptor gets less responsive, so the same dose does less. We show it as your predicted response versus rested (≈X%). It recovers when you stop — over days to weeks depending on the receptor. This is the honest “tolerance” for opioids, psychedelics, benzodiazepines, dissociatives, and cannabis." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "反复使用后，受体的反应性下降，因此同样的剂量效果变弱。我们用相对于休息状态的预测反应（≈X%）来表示。停用后它会恢复——视受体不同，需数天到数周。这才是阿片类、致幻剂、苯二氮䓬、解离剂和大麻真正意义上的“耐受”。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "反覆使用後，受體的反應性下降，因此同樣的劑量效果變弱。我們用相對於休息狀態的預測反應（≈X%）來表示。停用後它會恢復——視受體不同，需數天到數週。這才是阿片類、致幻劑、苯二氮䓬、解離劑和大麻真正意義上的「耐受」。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Withdrawal" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "戒断"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "戒斷"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Within a session" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "同一次使用之内"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "同一次使用之內"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Within a session the high fades faster than the strain on your heart — chasing it with more stacks onto a blood-pressure spike that hasn't eased. Space your doses." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "一次嗨里，快感消退得比心脏的负担快——再加量去追，只会叠在一个还没缓下来的血压高峰上。把每次剂量间隔开。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "一次嗨裡，快感消退得比心臟的負擔快——再加量去追，只會疊在一個還沒緩下來的血壓高峰上。把每次劑量間隔開。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Within the window when symptoms for drugs like yours typically begin and peak." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "正处于此类药物症状通常开始并达到高峰的时间窗内。"
