          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You're out of %@. Restock when you can." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你的 %@ 已用尽。请尽快补充。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你的 %@ 已用盡。請盡快補充。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You're safe. If the experience was intense, remind yourself: it's temporary." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "您是安全的。如果体验很强烈,请提醒自己:这是暂时的。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "您是安全的。如果體驗很強烈,請提醒自己:這是暫時的。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You've already created this shade" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你已创建过此颜色"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你已建立過此顏色"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You've been going for over %lld hours. Try to wind down — dim the lights, put the phone away, and let yourself sleep." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "您已持续超过 %lld 小时。试着放松 — 调暗灯光、放下手机,让自己入睡。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "您已持續超過 %lld 小時。試著放鬆 — 調暗燈光、放下手機,讓自己入睡。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your ALDH2 variant clears acetaldehyde — the first, toxic by-product of alcohol — slowly, so it builds up and lingers. That build-up *is* the flush, racing heart, and nausea, and it's a Group 1 carcinogen (IARC): for flush-reactive drinkers each drink carries more long-term throat and oesophageal cancer risk. Less alcohol means less acetaldehyde — there's no amount that clears as cleanly as it does for others." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你的 ALDH2 变异清除乙醛——酒精的第一个毒性副产物——的速度很慢，因此它会堆积并滞留。这种堆积正是脸红、心跳加快和恶心的原因，而乙醛是一级致癌物（IARC）：对喝酒会脸红的人来说，每一杯都带来更高的长期咽喉与食道癌风险。少喝就意味着更少的乙醛——没有任何分量能像对别人那样被干净地清除掉。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你的 ALDH2 變異清除乙醛——酒精的第一個毒性副產物——的速度很慢，因此它會堆積並滯留。這種堆積正是臉紅、心跳加快和噁心的原因，而乙醛是一級致癌物（IARC）：對喝酒會臉紅的人來說，每一杯都帶來更高的長期咽喉與食道癌風險。少喝就意味著更少的乙醛——沒有任何分量能像對別人那樣被乾淨地清除掉。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your backup was restored." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
