            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "您的歷史"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your journal lives locally. No sign-up, no account required." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你的日志保存在本地。无需注册，无需账号。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你的日誌保存在本機。無需註冊，無需帳號。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your key, your device" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你的密钥，你的设备"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你的金鑰，你的裝置"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your modeled GABA-A load has essentially cleared — past the point where the drug itself is still leaving your system. The bands below say when symptoms tend to follow." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你的 GABA-A 负荷模型显示已基本清除——药物本身已过了仍在离开体内的阶段。下方的区间表示症状通常何时随之出现。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你的 GABA-A 負荷模型顯示已基本清除——藥物本身已過了仍在離開體內的階段。下方的區間表示症狀通常何時隨之出現。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your modeled GABA-A load is still about %lld%% of your recent peak — the drug is still clearing, so withdrawal hasn't started yet." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你的 GABA-A 负荷模型仍约为近期峰值的 %lld%%——药物仍在清除，因此戒断尚未开始。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你的 GABA-A 負荷模型仍約為近期峰值的 %lld%%——藥物仍在清除，因此戒斷尚未開始。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your modeled GABA-A load is still about %lld%% of your recent peak — the drug is still clearing, so withdrawal hasn't started. On your current clearance it drops into the onset range in about %@." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你的 GABA-A 负荷模型仍约为近期峰值的 %1$lld%%——药物仍在清除，因此戒断尚未开始。按你目前的清除速度，大约再过 %2$@ 会进入起始区间。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你的 GABA-A 負荷模型仍約為近期峰值的 %1$lld%%——藥物仍在清除，因此戒斷尚未開始。按你目前的清除速度，大約再過 %2$@ 會進入起始區間。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your NMDA receptors are returning to baseline, which can feel foggy or unreal." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "您的 NMDA 受体正恢复到基线,可能感觉迷糊或不真实。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "您的 NMDA 受體正恢復到基線,可能感覺迷糊或不真實。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your Notes" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你的备注"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你的備註"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your own response shifts with tolerance, body chemistry, and the day. Talk to a prescriber about your medication." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你自身的反应会随耐受度、身体状况和当天情况而变化。有关你的用药，请咨询开药医生。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你自身的反應會隨耐受度、身體狀況和當天情況而變化。有關你的用藥，請諮詢開藥醫生。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your remaining amount stands out once it drops below this. Set to 0 to disable." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "当剩余量低于此值时会突出显示。设为 0 可停用。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "當剩餘量低於此值時會突出顯示。設為 0 可停用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your serotonin receptors are returning to their normal sensitivity." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "您的血清素受体正恢复到正常敏感度。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "您的血清素受體正恢復到正常敏感度。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your serotonin reserves are depleted — that's why everything feels flat or low." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "您的血清素储备已耗尽 — 这就是为什么一切感觉平淡或低落。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "您的血清素儲備已耗盡 — 這就是為什麼一切感覺平淡或低落。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your serotonin system is taking a hit. Please rest and take care of yourself." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "您的血清素系统正承受压力。请休息并照顾好自己。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "您的血清素系統正承受壓力。請休息並照顧好自己。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your streak and this month's rate" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你的连续天数与本月比例"
